{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01RdYjjTqEpDUPsamnUdLRV8","type":"tool_result","content":"1\tnarrative_guidance: 'Tier B narrative. Real contamination is detectable but moderate\n2\t  (c_n median ~0.5). G-MFRM ranking improvement over best baselines is statistically\n3\t  significant but practically modest (+2-3pp Kendall-τ). Pivot primary contribution\n4\t  to diagnostic/interpretability outputs: per-model c_n as training data audit tool,\n5\t  per-item e_i for item retirement decisions, per-judge d_j for judge selection guidance.\n6\t  Lead argument: ''Sequential methods provide no visibility into whether corrections\n7\t  are needed — G-MFRM provides both correction and diagnosis.'' Forward-looking: as\n8\t  contamination grows, joint estimation becomes critical. May need exp-010 (WildBench)\n9\t  to strengthen empirical package with a third benchmark.\n10\t\n11\t  '\n12\timagined_experiments:\n13\t- name: multi_judge_data_collection\n14\t  plan_id: exp-001\n15\t  description: 'Collect multi-judge evaluation data on MT-Bench and Arena-Hard using\n16\t    8 judges. 20+ target models evaluated with position swap.\n17\t\n18\t    '\n19\t  expected_results:\n20\t    num_judges: 8\n21\t    num_target_models: 22\n22\t    benchmarks:\n23\t    - MT-Bench\n24\t    - Arena-Hard\n25\t    total_judgments_mt_bench: 28160\n26\t    total_judgments_arena_hard: 35200\n27\t    position_bias_detected_judges: 3\n28\t    api_cost_usd: 820\n29\t    gpu_hours_used: 118\n30\t    missing_data_pct: 2.1\n31\t    inter_judge_agreement_fleiss_kappa: 0.38\n32\t  result_rationale: 'Median档下，8个judge的评分会展现出中等程度的一致性（Fleiss κ~0.38），反映了judge之间severity差异的真实存在。\n33\t    22个target model覆盖了从GPT-5.5到开源7B模型的能力梯度，确保contamination susceptibility的变异性。 Position\n34\t    bias在3个judge上显著（主要是较小的开源judge），这为d_j估计提供了必要的judge间变异。 缺失数据约2%来自API超时和vLLM偶发OOM，在可接受范围内。\n35\t\n36\t    '\n37\t  tables:\n38\t  - name: 'Table A1: Judge × Benchmark Data Collection Summary'\n39\t    columns:\n40\t    - Judge\n41\t    - MT-Bench Items\n42\t    - Arena-Hard Items\n43\t    - Position Swap\n44\t    - Missing %\n45\t    - Mean Score\n46\t    sample_rows:\n47\t    - - GPT-5.5\n48\t      - 1760\n49\t      - 2200\n50\t      - 'Yes'\n51\t      - 0.0%\n52\t      - '7.82'\n53\t    - - Claude Opus 4.7\n54\t      - 1760\n55\t      - 2200\n56\t      - 'Yes'\n57\t      - 0.0%\n58\t      - '7.45'\n59\t    - - Claude Sonnet 4.6\n60\t      - 1760\n61\t      - 2200\n62\t      - 'Yes'\n63\t      - 0.0%\n64\t      - '7.61'\n65\t    - - DeepSeek-V4-Pro\n66\t      - 1760\n67\t      - 2200\n68\t      - 'Yes'\n69\t      - 1.8%\n70\t      - '7.28'\n71\t    - - Qwen3-235B-A22B\n72\t      - 1760\n73\t      - 2200\n74\t      - 'Yes'\n75\t      - 2.5%\n76\t      - '7.15'\n77\t    - - Qwen3.6-27B\n78\t      - 1760\n79\t      - 2200\n80\t      - 'Yes'\n81\t      - 4.2%\n82\t      - '6.93'\n83\t    - - Llama 4 Maverick\n84\t      - 1760\n85\t      - 2200\n86\t      - 'Yes'\n87\t      - 3.1%\n88\t      - '7.05'\n89\t    - - Gemma3-27B\n90\t      - 1760\n91\t      - 2200\n92\t      - 'Yes'\n93\t      - 2.8%\n94\t      - '6.88'\n95\t  figures_description:\n96\t  - 'Fig S1: Judge score distribution heatmap (judge × target model), showing systematic\n97\t    severity differences across judges.'\n98\t  analysis: '数据收集本身不直接验证claim，但数据质量决定了后续实验的上限。 Judge间score分布差异（mean range: 6.88–7.82）确认了judge\n99\t    severity变异的存在，为d_j估计提供信号。 中等的inter-judge agreement (κ~0.38) 意味着judge bias correction有实际意义。\n100\t\n101\t    '\n102\t- name: item_exposure_estimation\n103\t  plan_id: exp-002\n104\t  description: '三源pipeline估计per-item exposure e_i。Primary source: 原始vs改写变体的performance\n105\t    gap； Temporal: pre/post-cutoff变体gap；LogProber: token logprob memorization scores。\n106\t    加权组合后用ConStat per-model delta做外部验证。\n107\t\n108\t    '\n109\t  expected_results:\n110\t    num_items_mt_bench: 80\n111\t    num_items_arena_hard: 100\n112\t    reference_variants_created: 180\n113\t    primary_source_coverage: 1.0\n114\t    temporal_source_coverage: 0.45\n115\t    logprober_source_coverage: 0.55\n116\t    composite_e_i_mean: 0.32\n117\t    composite_e_i_std: 0.21\n118\t    composite_e_i_range:\n119\t    - 0.0\n120\t    - 0.82\n121\t    high_exposure_items_pct: 18.0\n122\t    primary_temporal_correlation: 0.58\n123\t    primary_logprober_correlation: 0.41\n124\t    weighted_composite_internal_consistency_alpha: 0.62\n125\t    constat_cn_vs_gmfrm_cn_spearman: 0.52\n126\t  result_rationale: 'Median档假设real contamination moderate，因此e_i分布右偏但不极端：大部分items（~82%）的e_i\n127\t    < 0.5， 仅少数items（~18%）有明显的contamination exposure。这与\"contamination exists but is\n128\t    moderate\"一致。 Primary source（performance gap）覆盖率100%且信号最强；temporal source覆盖率有限（仅45%的items有\n129\t    pre/post-cutoff变体），但与primary的相关性中等（r=0.58）。LogProber覆盖率55%（仅有logprob API的模型），\n130\t    且与primary相关性较弱（r=0.41）——这是median档的关键特征之一：\"one source contributes little\"。 内部一致性α=0.62反映了三源信号的中等coherence，足以构建可用的composite但不overwhelming。\n131\t    ConStat验证ρ=0.52落在[0.4, 0.7)范围内，表明fitted c_n与外部contamination measure有中等agreement。\n132\t\n133\t    '\n134\t  tables:\n135\t  - name: 'Table 2: Exposure Indicator Source Comparison'\n136\t    columns:\n137\t    - Source\n138\t    - Coverage\n139\t    - Mean e_i\n140\t    - Std\n141\t    - Correlation w/ Composite\n142\t    sample_rows:\n143\t    - - Primary (performance gap)\n144\t      - 100%\n145\t      - '0.30'\n146\t      - '0.22'\n147\t      - '0.91'\n148\t    - - Temporal (pre/post cutoff)\n149\t      - 45%\n150\t      - '0.35'\n151\t      - '0.25'\n152\t      - '0.72'\n153\t    - - LogProber (logprob)\n154\t      - 55%\n155\t      - '0.28'\n156\t      - '0.19'\n157\t      - '0.58'\n158\t    - - Weighted Composite\n159\t      - 100%\n160\t      - '0.32'\n161\t      - '0.21'\n162\t      - '1.00'\n163\t  - name: 'Table S2: High-Exposure Items (e_i > 0.5)'\n164\t    columns:\n165\t    - Benchmark\n166\t    - Item ID\n167\t    - e_i\n168\t    - Primary\n169\t    - Temporal\n170\t    - LogProber\n171\t    - Category\n172\t    note: ~32 items total (18% of 180). Concentrated in coding and math categories.\n173\t  figures_description:\n174\t  - 'Fig 2(a): e_i histogram across all items, showing right-skewed distribution with\n175\t    mode near 0.15 and tail to 0.82.'\n176\t  - 'Fig 2(b): Source-pair scatter plots (primary vs temporal, primary vs LogProber)\n177\t    with regression lines.'\n178\t  - 'Fig S2: Per-benchmark e_i distribution comparison (MT-Bench vs Arena-Hard).'\n179\t  analysis: 'e_i pipeline产生合理的exposure estimates，但LogProber贡献有限。这意味着在ablation（exp-007）中，\n180\t    去除LogProber对composite质量影响较小，2/3 sources sufficient。 MT-Bench的coding/math items的e_i系统性高于reasoning/writing\n181\t    items， 与contamination通过training data leakage的机制一致。 Arena-Hard的e_i整体略低于MT-Bench，可能因Arena-Hard更新更频繁、泄露窗口更短。\n182\t\n183\t    '\n184\t- name: gmfrm_real_data_fit\n185\t  plan_id: exp-003\n186\t  description: '在exp-001/002的real data上拟合G-MFRM三阶段pipeline。 Stage 1: MFRM估计(θ,b,d)。Stage\n187\t    2: 固定exp-002的e_i。Stage 3: Joint gated model。 输出fair scores θ̂并与Chatbot Arena Elo对比。\n188\t\n189\t    '\n190\t  expected_results:\n191\t    stage1_max_rhat: 1.02\n192\t    stage1_min_ess: 380\n193\t    stage3_max_rhat: 1.07\n194\t    stage3_min_ess: 142\n195\t    stage3_divergent_transitions: 12\n196\t    theta_range:\n197\t    - -1.8\n198\t    - 2.1\n199\t    d_j_range:\n200\t    - -0.62\n201\t    - 0.48\n202\t    d_j_std: 0.31\n203\t    c_n_median: 0.48\n204\t    c_n_mean: 0.54\n205\t    c_n_range:\n206\t    - 0.05\n207\t    - 1.35\n208\t    c_n_gt_0_3_count: 13\n209\t    c_n_gt_0_8_count: 4\n210\t    kendall_tau_arena_mt_bench: 0.87\n211\t    kendall_tau_arena_arena_hard: 0.86\n212\t    spearman_rho_arena_mt_bench: 0.91\n213\t    spearman_rho_arena_arena_hard: 0.9\n214\t    arena_hard_subset_low_contamination_tau_gmfrm: 0.88\n215\t    arena_hard_subset_low_contamination_tau_mfrm: 0.87\n216\t    runtime_seconds: 8400\n217\t    mcmc_warmup: 2000\n218\t    mcmc_samples: 4000\n219\t    mcmc_chains: 4\n220\t  result_rationale: 'Median档的核心特征在此实验集中体现。c_n median=0.48落在[0.3, 0.8)区间， 接近mvp_001的weak\n221\t    contamination而非mvp_003的strong contamination。 22个模型中13个有c_n > 0.3（moderate），仅4个有c_n\n222\t    > 0.8（heavy）， 说明contamination普遍存在但幅度有限。 Stage 3收敛需要调优：R̂=1.07（≤1.10但不ideal）、ESS=142（≥100但远低于mvp_003的224），\n223\t    12个divergent transitions提示geometry有困难但未破坏inference。 这是因为moderate contamination意味着c_n的posterior更diffuse（数据对c_n的约束力较弱），\n224\t    MCMC更难探索。Kendall-τ=0.87落在[0.84, 0.9]范围，比raw average显著提升但不dramatic。 低contamination子集上G-MFRM与MFRM几乎无差异（0.88\n225\t    vs 0.87），确认graceful degradation。\n226\t\n227\t    '\n228\t  tables:\n229\t  - name: 'Table 3: G-MFRM Convergence Diagnostics'\n230\t    columns:\n231\t    - Parameter Group\n232\t    - Max R̂\n233\t    - Min ESS\n234\t    - Mean ESS\n235\t    - Divergent Transitions\n236\t    sample_rows:\n237\t    - - θ (model ability)\n238\t      - '1.03'\n239\t      - '285'\n240\t      - '420'\n241\t      - '0'\n242\t    - - b (item difficulty)\n243\t      - '1.02'\n244\t      - '310'\n245\t      - '465'\n246\t      - '0'\n247\t    - - d (judge severity)\n248\t      - '1.02'\n249\t      - '340'\n250\t      - '490'\n251\t      - '0'\n252\t    - - c (contamination)\n253\t      - '1.07'\n254\t      - '142'\n255\t      - '215'\n256\t      - '12'\n257\t  - name: 'Table 4: Per-Model Parameter Estimates (sorted by θ̂)'\n258\t    columns:\n259\t    - Model\n260\t    - θ̂ (fair)\n261\t    - θ_raw\n262\t    - c_n\n263\t    - c_n 95%CI\n264\t    - Rank_fair\n265\t    - Rank_raw\n266\t    - Δ Rank\n267\t    sample_rows:\n268\t    - - GPT-5.5\n269\t      - '1.95'\n270\t      - '2.08'\n271\t      - '0.72'\n272\t      - '[0.38, 1.12]'\n273\t      - '1'\n274\t      - '1'\n275\t      - '0'\n276\t    - - Claude Opus 4.7\n277\t      - '1.82'\n278\t      - '1.85'\n279\t      - '0.21'\n280\t      - '[0.03, 0.52]'\n281\t      - '2'\n282\t      - '3'\n283\t      - '+1'\n284\t    - - DeepSeek-V4-Pro\n285\t      - '1.71'\n286\t      - '1.92'\n287\t      - '1.15'\n288\t      - '[0.68, 1.35]'\n289\t      - '3'\n290\t      - '2'\n291\t      - '-1'\n292\t    - - Qwen3-235B-A22B\n293\t      - '1.45'\n294\t      - '1.58'\n295\t      - '0.65'\n296\t      - '[0.31, 1.02]'\n297\t      - '5'\n298\t      - '4'\n299\t      - '-1'\n300\t    - - Model-X-70B\n301\t      - '0.85'\n302\t      - '1.10'\n303\t      - '1.28'\n304\t      - '[0.85, 1.35]'\n305\t      - '10'\n306\t      - '7'\n307\t      - '-3'\n308\t    - - Small-7B-Chat\n309\t      - '-1.52'\n310\t      - '-1.48'\n311\t      - '0.08'\n312\t      - '[0.01, 0.28]'\n313\t      - '22'\n314\t      - '22'\n315\t      - '0'\n316\t  - name: 'Table S3: Per-Judge Severity Estimates'\n317\t    columns:\n318\t    - Judge\n319\t    - d_j\n320\t    - d_j 95%CI\n321\t    - Interpretation\n322\t    sample_rows:\n323\t    - - GPT-5.5\n324\t      - '-0.15'\n325\t      - '[-0.32, 0.02]'\n326\t      - Slightly lenient\n327\t    - - Claude Opus 4.7\n328\t      - '0.08'\n329\t      - '[-0.10, 0.25]'\n330\t      - Near neutral\n331\t    - - Qwen3.6-27B\n332\t      - '0.48'\n333\t      - '[0.28, 0.68]'\n334\t      - Most severe\n335\t    - - Llama 4 Maverick\n336\t      - '-0.62'\n337\t      - '[-0.85, -0.40]'\n338\t      - Most lenient\n339\t  figures_description:\n340\t  - 'Fig 3: Scatter plot of θ̂_fair vs Chatbot Arena Elo, colored by c_n magnitude.\n341\t    High-c_n models pulled downward relative to raw scores.'\n342\t  - 'Fig 4: c_n posterior density plots for all 22 models, ordered by posterior median.\n343\t    Shows moderate contamination landscape.'\n344\t  - 'Fig S3: Trace plots for c_n of 4 highest-contamination models, showing adequate\n345\t    mixing despite slower convergence.'\n346\t  - 'Fig S4: θ̂_raw vs θ̂_fair with identity line; deviations annotated with model\n347\t    names.'\n348\t  analysis: 'G-MFRM成功拟合real data，收敛可接受但不完美（c_n的ESS偏低）。 c_n median=0.48确认了median档预期：contamination存在且可量化，但幅度moderate。\n349\t    关键发现：4个模型（DeepSeek-V4-Pro, Qwen3-235B-A22B, Model-X-70B, 另一个）的c_n > 0.8， 这些模型的fair\n350\t    score显著低于raw score，产生了有意义的rank changes。 但top-5整体稳定（仅1-2个位置变动），限制了ranking correction的headline\n351\t    impact。 Per-judge d_j range（-0.62 to 0.48）确认judge severity差异显著， 为\"judge selection\n352\t    guidance\"这一diagnostic贡献提供了直接证据。\n353\t\n354\t    '\n355\t- name: baseline_comparison\n356\t  plan_id: exp-004\n357\t  description: 'G-MFRM vs 8条baselines在相同数据上对比。 包含rank change analysis：具体哪些模型换位、换多少位、top-k稳定性。\n358\t\n359\t    '\n360\t  expected_results:\n361\t    tau_raw_average: 0.79\n362\t    tau_mfrm_only: 0.82\n363\t    tau_sequential: 0.84\n364\t    tau_cyclicjudge: 0.83\n365\t    tau_cyclicjudge_discard: 0.85\n366\t    tau_dcr_factor: 0.81\n367\t    tau_uda: 0.84\n368\t    tau_pref_leakage_cal: 0.82\n369\t    tau_gmfrm: 0.87\n370\t    rho_raw_average: 0.83\n371\t    rho_mfrm_only: 0.86\n372\t    rho_sequential: 0.88\n373\t    rho_cyclicjudge: 0.87\n374\t    rho_cyclicjudge_discard: 0.89\n375\t    rho_dcr_factor: 0.85\n376\t    rho_uda: 0.88\n377\t    rho_pref_leakage_cal: 0.86\n378\t    rho_gmfrm: 0.91\n379\t    tau_gmfrm_arena_hard: 0.86\n380\t    tau_best_baseline_arena_hard: 0.84\n381\t    delta_tau_vs_best_baseline_mt_bench: 0.02\n382\t    delta_tau_vs_best_baseline_arena_hard: 0.02\n383\t    wilcoxon_gmfrm_vs_cyclicjudge_discard_p: 0.073\n384\t    wilcoxon_gmfrm_vs_sequential_p: 0.018\n385\t    wilcoxon_gmfrm_vs_raw_p: 0.001\n386\t    rank_changes_ge2_positions: 2\n387\t    top5_stability_raw_vs_gmfrm: 4/5 same\n388\t    top10_stability_raw_vs_gmfrm: 7/10 same\n389\t    max_rank_change_model: Model-X-70B\n390\t    max_rank_change_positions: 3\n391\t  result_rationale: 'Median档的核心tension在此实验体现：G-MFRM beats all baselines但margin modest。\n392\t    Δτ=+0.02 vs CyclicJudge+discard（best baseline），p=0.073——borderline significant。\n393\t    这是因为moderate contamination意味着contamination correction的marginal value有限： CyclicJudge+discard已经通过丢弃high-exposure\n394\t    items移除了大部分contamination signal， G-MFRM的优势在于保留这些items的information（不丢弃）而非dramatically改变ranking。\n395\t    vs sequential (p=0.018) 和 vs raw (p=0.001) 则显著，因为这些baseline完全不处理contamination。\n396\t    Rank changes limited to 2个models移动≥2位，最大移动3位（Model-X-70B: raw rank 7→fair rank\n397\t    10）， top-5有4/5不变——这限制了\"G-MFRM dramatically corrects rankings\"的narrative， 但支持\"G-MFRM\n398\t    provides correction where needed + diagnostic visibility everywhere\"的Tier B framing。\n399\t    UDA的τ=0.84与sequential持平，说明neural K-factor adjustment在有contamination时也受confounding影响。\n400\t\n401\t    '\n402\t  tables:\n403\t  - name: 'Table 5: Main Results — Agreement with Chatbot Arena Human Votes'\n404\t    columns:\n405\t    - Method\n406\t    - MT-Bench τ\n407\t    - MT-Bench ρ\n408\t    - Arena-Hard τ\n409\t    - Arena-Hard ρ\n410\t    - p vs G-MFRM\n411\t    sample_rows:\n412\t    - - Raw Multi-Judge Avg\n413\t      - '0.79'\n414\t      - '0.83'\n415\t      - '0.78'\n416\t      - '0.82'\n417\t      - '0.001'\n418\t    - - MFRM-only\n419\t      - '0.82'\n420\t      - '0.86'\n421\t      - '0.81'\n422\t      - '0.85'\n423\t      - '0.009'\n424\t    - - Sequential Pipeline\n425\t      - '0.84'\n426\t      - '0.88'\n427\t      - '0.83'\n428\t      - '0.87'\n429\t      - '0.018'\n430\t    - - CyclicJudge\n431\t      - '0.83'\n432\t      - '0.87'\n433\t      - '0.82'\n434\t      - '0.86'\n435\t      - '0.025'\n436\t    - - CyclicJudge + Discard\n437\t      - '0.85'\n438\t      - '0.89'\n439\t      - '0.84'\n440\t      - '0.88'\n441\t      - '0.073'\n442\t    - - DCR Factor\n443\t      - '0.81'\n444\t      - '0.85'\n445\t      - '0.80'\n446\t      - '0.84'\n447\t      - '0.005'\n448\t    - - UDA\n449\t      - '0.84'\n450\t      - '0.88'\n451\t      - '0.83'\n452\t      - '0.87'\n453\t      - '0.021'\n454\t    - - Pref. Leakage Cal.\n455\t      - '0.82'\n456\t      - '0.86'\n457\t      - '0.81'\n458\t      - '0.85'\n459\t      - '0.008'\n460\t    - - '**G-MFRM (ours)**'\n461\t      - '**0.87**'\n462\t      - '**0.91**'\n463\t      - '**0.86**'\n464\t      - '**0.90**'\n465\t      - —\n466\t  - name: 'Table 6: Rank Change Analysis (G-MFRM Fair vs Raw Average)'\n467\t    columns:\n468\t    - Model\n469\t    - Raw Rank\n470\t    - G-MFRM Rank\n471\t    - Δ Rank\n472\t    - c_n\n473\t    - Moved ≥2?\n474\t    sample_rows:\n475\t    - - GPT-5.5\n476\t      - '1'\n477\t      - '1'\n478\t      - '0'\n479\t      - '0.72'\n480\t      - 'No'\n481\t    - - DeepSeek-V4-Pro\n482\t      - '2'\n483\t      - '3'\n484\t      - '-1'\n485\t      - '1.15'\n486\t      - 'No'\n487\t    - - Claude Opus 4.7\n488\t      - '3'\n489\t      - '2'\n490\t      - '+1'\n491\t      - '0.21'\n492\t      - 'No'\n493\t    - - Qwen3-235B-A22B\n494\t      - '4'\n495\t      - '5'\n496\t      - '-1'\n497\t      - '0.65'\n498\t      - 'No'\n499\t    - - Model-Y-Pro\n500\t      - '6'\n501\t      - '4'\n502\t      - '+2'\n503\t      - '0.12'\n504\t      - 'Yes'\n505\t    - - Model-X-70B\n506\t      - '7'\n507\t      - '10'\n508\t      - '-3'\n509\t      - '1.28'\n510\t      - 'Yes'\n511\t  - name: 'Table 6b: Top-k Stability'\n512\t    columns:\n513\t    - k\n514\t    - Overlap(raw, G-MFRM)\n515\t    - Overlap(CJ+discard, G-MFRM)\n516\t    - Overlap(sequential, G-MFRM)\n517\t    sample_rows:\n518\t    - - '5'\n519\t      - 4/5 (80%)\n520\t      - 5/5 (100%)\n521\t      - 4/5 (80%)\n522\t    - - '10'\n523\t      - 7/10 (70%)\n524\t      - 9/10 (90%)\n525\t      - 8/10 (80%)\n526\t  figures_description:\n527\t  - 'Fig 5: Bar chart of Kendall-τ across all methods, both benchmarks side by side.\n528\t    G-MFRM highest but margin small.'\n529\t  - 'Fig 6: Rank comparison alluvial diagram — raw ranks → G-MFRM fair ranks, highlighting\n530\t    the 2 models with ≥2 position change.'\n531\t  - 'Fig 7: Diagnostic output comparison matrix — checkmarks for which methods provide\n532\t    θ, d_j, c_n, e_i outputs. Only G-MFRM provides all four.'\n533\t  analysis: 'G-MFRM在所有metrics上numerically best，但vs CyclicJudge+discard的优势borderline\n534\t    (p=0.073)。 这正是median档Tier B narrative的触发条件。 Fig 7（diagnostic output comparison）成为关键卖点：所有baseline只输出corrected\n535\t    scores， G-MFRM额外输出per-model c_n、per-item e_i、per-judge d_j——这是unique contribution。\n536\t    Rank change分析显示corrections targeted：Model-X-70B下降3位（c_n=1.28，最重contamination），\n537\t    但大多数模型rank变化≤1位，说明moderate contamination下校正是surgical而非sweeping。\n538\t\n539\t    '\n540\t- name: contamination_magnitude_calibration\n541\t  plan_id: exp-005\n542\t  description: '将exp-003的fitted c_n与MVP synthetic assumptions对比，确定real contamination\n543\t    magnitude所在区间。\n544\t\n545\t    '\n546\t  expected_results:\n547\t    c_n_median_fitted: 0.48\n548\t    c_n_mean_fitted: 0.54\n549\t    c_n_p25: 0.18\n550\t    c_n_p75: 0.78\n551\t    closest_mvp: between mvp_001 (c~0.5) and mvp_002 (c~1.5), closer to mvp_001\n552\t    tier_determination: median → Tier B\n553\t    models_with_c_n_gt_1: 2\n554\t    models_with_c_n_lt_0_1: 5\n555\t    c_n_distribution_shape: right-skewed, mode near 0.2, long tail to ~1.35\n556\t    constat_delta_vs_c_n_spearman: 0.52\n557\t    constat_delta_vs_c_n_pearson: 0.47\n558\t  result_rationale: 'c_n median=0.48直接落在median档定义的[0.3, 0.8)区间内。这接近mvp_001（c~0.5）而非mvp_002/003（c~1.5）。\n559\t    分布右偏（mode~0.2, median~0.48, mean~0.54）反映了真实情况：大多数模型contamination轻微， 少数模型（likely\n560\t    trained on leaked benchmark data）有较高contamination。 仅2个模型的c_n > 1.0，说明\"heavy contamination\"是exception而非norm——\n561\t    这解释了为什么G-MFRM的ranking improvement modest：只有少数模型需要大幅校正。 ConStat validation ρ=0.52（[0.4,\n562\t    0.7)范围）提供了moderate external validation， 说明c_n captures real contamination signal但不是perfect\n563\t    proxy（ConStat measures different aspect）。 这个结果正式触发Tier B narrative decision。\n564\t\n565\t    '\n566\t  tables:\n567\t  - name: 'Table 7: Contamination Magnitude — Real vs Synthetic'\n568\t    columns:\n569\t    - Statistic\n570\t    - Real Data (exp-003)\n571\t    - MVP_001 (synthetic)\n572\t    - MVP_002 (synthetic)\n573\t    - MVP_003 (synthetic)\n574\t    sample_rows:\n575\t    - - c_n median\n576\t      - '0.48'\n577\t      - '0.50'\n578\t      - '1.50'\n579\t      - '1.50'\n580\t    - - c_n mean\n581\t      - '0.54'\n582\t      - '0.50'\n583\t      - '1.50'\n584\t      - '1.50'\n585\t    - - c_n std\n586\t      - '0.35'\n587\t      - '0.10'\n588\t      - '0.30'\n589\t      - '0.30'\n590\t    - - c_n range\n591\t      - '[0.05, 1.35]'\n592\t      - '[0.3, 0.7]'\n593\t      - '[0.8, 2.0]'\n594\t      - '[0.8, 2.0]'\n595\t    - - '% models c_n > 0.8'\n596\t      - 18%\n597\t      - 0%\n598\t      - 100%\n599\t      - 100%\n600\t  - name: 'Table S5: ConStat Validation'\n601\t    columns:\n602\t    - Metric\n603\t    - Value\n604\t    - 95% CI\n605\t    sample_rows:\n606\t    - - Spearman ρ (ConStat Δ vs c_n)\n607\t      - '0.52'\n608\t      - '[0.31, 0.69]'\n609\t    - - Pearson r (ConStat Δ vs c_n)\n610\t      - '0.47'\n611\t      - '[0.25, 0.65]'\n612\t    - - Kendall τ (ConStat Δ vs c_n)\n613\t      - '0.38'\n614\t      - '[0.18, 0.55]'\n615\t  figures_description:\n616\t  - 'Fig 8: c_n distribution overlay — real data (histogram) vs MVP_001 and MVP_003\n617\t    synthetic (density curves). Real data closest to MVP_001 but with heavier tail.'\n618\t  - 'Fig 9: Scatter plot of ConStat per-model Δ vs G-MFRM c_n, with ρ=0.52 annotated.'\n619\t  analysis: 'This is the tier-determining experiment. c_n median=0.48确认Tier B。 关键implication：ranking\n620\t    correction虽然有效但不dramatic，paper必须pivot to diagnostic contribution。 但分布的heavy tail（2个模型c_n\n621\t    > 1.0）提供了\"contamination can be severe for specific models\"的evidence， 支持forward-looking\n622\t    argument：\"as contamination grows, joint estimation becomes increasingly critical。\"\n623\t    ConStat中等验证(ρ=0.52)说明c_n不是noise但也不是perfect——足以claim validity，不足以claim definitive。\n624\t\n625\t    '\n626\t- name: judge_count_sensitivity\n627\t  plan_id: exp-006\n628\t  description: 'Judge数量敏感性分析：2/4/6/8个judges下G-MFRM performance degradation。\n629\t\n630\t    '\n631\t  expected_results:\n632\t    tau_2_judges: 0.81\n633\t    tau_4_judges: 0.85\n634\t    tau_6_judges: 0.86\n635\t    tau_8_judges: 0.87\n636\t    tau_2_judges_mfrm_only: 0.8\n637\t    tau_4_judges_mfrm_only: 0.82\n638\t    delta_gmfrm_vs_sequential_2_judges: 0.0\n639\t    delta_gmfrm_vs_sequential_4_judges: 0.01\n640\t    delta_gmfrm_vs_sequential_6_judges: 0.02\n641\t    delta_gmfrm_vs_sequential_8_judges: 0.03\n642\t    min_judges_for_significant_gain: 5\n643\t    convergence_2_judges_max_rhat: 1.25\n644\t    convergence_4_judges_max_rhat: 1.09\n645\t    convergence_6_judges_max_rhat: 1.08\n646\t    convergence_8_judges_max_rhat: 1.07\n647\t  result_rationale: 'Median档假设min judge count for significant gain在[4, 6]范围。预测5个judges是拐点。\n648\t    2 judges时G-MFRM无法区分judge severity和contamination（under-identified）， 退化到MFRM-level（τ=0.81\n649\t    vs MFRM τ=0.80），R̂=1.25表明不收敛—— 这是graceful degradation的empirical validation。 4\n650\t    judges开始有信号但gain仍小（Δτ=+0.01），因为moderate contamination下 4个judge的cross-information不足以精确估计c_n\n651\t    posterior。 6-8 judges时gain stabilize（Δτ=+0.02-0.03），c_n posterior tighten。 这个结果支持\"≥5\n652\t    judges recommended\"的practitioner guidance， 也诚实地展示了G-MFRM的practical limitation。\n653\t\n654\t    '\n655\t  tables:\n656\t  - name: 'Table 8: Judge Count Sensitivity'\n657\t    columns:\n658\t    - '# Judges'\n659\t    - G-MFRM τ\n660\t    - Sequential τ\n661\t    - Δτ\n662\t    - Max R̂\n663\t    - Min ESS\n664\t    - Significant? (p<0.05)\n665\t    sample_rows:\n666\t    - - '2'\n667\t      - '0.81'\n668\t      - '0.81'\n669\t      - '0.00'\n670\t      - '1.25'\n671\t      - '35'\n672\t      - 'No'\n673\t    - - '4'\n674\t      - '0.85'\n675\t      - '0.84'\n676\t      - '+0.01'\n677\t      - '1.09'\n678\t      - '92'\n679\t      - 'No'\n680\t    - - '5'\n681\t      - '0.86'\n682\t      - '0.84'\n683\t      - '+0.02'\n684\t      - '1.08'\n685\t      - '115'\n686\t      - Yes (p=0.04)\n687\t    - - '6'\n688\t      - '0.86'\n689\t      - '0.84'\n690\t      - '+0.02'\n691\t      - '1.08'\n692\t      - '128'\n693\t      - Yes (p=0.03)\n694\t    - - '8'\n695\t      - '0.87'\n696\t      - '0.84'\n697\t      - '+0.03'\n698\t      - '1.07'\n699\t      - '142'\n700\t      - Yes (p=0.02)\n701\t  figures_description:\n702\t  - 'Fig 10: Line plot of Kendall-τ vs judge count for G-MFRM, MFRM, sequential, and\n703\t    raw average. G-MFRM curve diverges from sequential at 4+ judges.'\n704\t  - 'Fig S6: R̂ and ESS vs judge count, showing convergence improves monotonically.'\n705\t  analysis: '实用建议：5个judges是cost-benefit sweet spot。2个judges时G-MFRM无害（graceful degradation\n706\t    to MFRM） 但也无contamination-correction benefit。 Addresses Reviewer Concern #8：cost-benefit明确，4\n707\t    judges下G-MFRM不worse than MFRM， practitioners不需要担心\"judges不够多时method会hurt\"。\n708\t\n709\t    '\n710\t- name: exposure_indicator_ablation\n711\t  plan_id: exp-007\n712\t  description: 'Leave-one-out ablation：每次移除一个e_i source，测量对downstream θ̂质量的影响。\n713\t\n714\t    '\n715\t  expected_results:\n716\t    full_tau: 0.87\n717\t    full_c_n_recovery_rmse: 0.22\n718\t    no_logprober_tau: 0.865\n719\t    no_logprober_c_n_rmse: 0.24\n720\t    no_logprober_delta_tau: -0.005\n721\t    no_temporal_tau: 0.86\n722\t    no_temporal_c_n_rmse: 0.26\n723\t    no_temporal_delta_tau: -0.01\n724\t    no_primary_tau: 0.83\n725\t    no_primary_c_n_rmse: 0.38\n726\t    no_primary_delta_tau: -0.04\n727\t    only_primary_tau: 0.86\n728\t    only_primary_c_n_rmse: 0.27\n729\t  result_rationale: 'Median档假设\"one source contributes little\"，这里是LogProber。 去除LogProber几乎不影响downstream\n730\t    performance（Δτ=-0.005），因为： (1) LogProber覆盖率仅55%，缺失模型需要impute； (2) LogProber与primary\n731\t    source的correlation最低（r=0.41），其unique information有限； (3) moderate contamination下，token-level\n732\t    memorization信号弱于item-level performance gap。 去除temporal影响稍大（Δτ=-0.01）但仍modest，因覆盖率仅45%。\n733\t    去除primary source影响显著（Δτ=-0.04），因它是唯一100%覆盖的source且与contamination最直接相关。 关键结论：2/3\n734\t    sources (primary + temporal) 几乎match full pipeline， 这简化了practitioners的pipeline——不需要LogProber\n735\t    access也能获得good e_i estimates。\n736\t\n737\t    '\n738\t  tables:\n739\t  - name: 'Table 9: Exposure Indicator Ablation'\n740\t    columns:\n741\t    - Configuration\n742\t    - Sources Used\n743\t    - e_i Coverage\n744\t    - G-MFRM τ\n745\t    - c_n RMSE\n746\t    - Δτ vs Full\n747\t    sample_rows:\n748\t    - - Full Pipeline\n749\t      - Primary + Temporal + LogProber\n750\t      - 100%\n751\t      - '0.870'\n752\t      - '0.22'\n753\t      - —\n754\t    - - −LogProber\n755\t      - Primary + Temporal\n756\t      - 100%\n757\t      - '0.865'\n758\t      - '0.24'\n759\t      - −0.005\n760\t    - - −Temporal\n761\t      - Primary + LogProber\n762\t      - 100%\n763\t      - '0.860'\n764\t      - '0.26'\n765\t      - −0.010\n766\t    - - −Primary\n767\t      - Temporal + LogProber\n768\t      - 55%\n769\t      - '0.830'\n770\t      - '0.38'\n771\t      - −0.040\n772\t    - - Primary Only\n773\t      - Primary\n774\t      - 100%\n775\t      - '0.860'\n776\t      - '0.27'\n777\t      - −0.010\n778\t  figures_description:\n779\t  - 'Fig 11: Bar chart of Kendall-τ for each ablation configuration, with error bars\n780\t    from bootstrap.'\n781\t  analysis: 'Primary source是backbone，贡献最大。LogProber可被省略（对practitioners友好）。 Temporal有marginal但real\n782\t    contribution（+0.005 τ over primary-only），值得保留但non-essential。 这支持了\"2/3 sources\n783\t    sufficient\"的median档预期。 论文中应强调primary source的simplicity（仅需original + rephrased\n784\t    variants的performance gap）， 降低method的perceived complexity。\n785\t\n786\t    '\n787\t- name: facet_fit_diagnostics\n788\t  plan_id: exp-008\n789\t  description: 'Measurement quality validation：infit/outfit MNSQ, person-fit (lz,\n790\t    EMRi), divergent transitions, posterior predictive checks, trace plots。\n791\t\n792\t    '\n793\t  expected_results:\n794\t    theta_infit_mnsq_range:\n795\t    - 0.72\n796\t    - 1.35\n797\t    theta_outfit_mnsq_range:\n798\t    - 0.68\n799\t    - 1.42\n800\t    theta_misfitting_count: 2\n801\t    item_infit_mnsq_range:\n802\t    - 0.78\n803\t    - 1.28\n804\t    item_misfitting_count: 5\n805\t    judge_infit_mnsq_range:\n806\t    - 0.82\n807\t    - 1.22\n808\t    judge_misfitting_count: 1\n809\t    c_n_infit_mnsq_range:\n810\t    - 0.65\n811\t    - 1.48\n812\t    c_n_misfitting_count: 3\n813\t    stage1_lz_flagged_models: 4\n814\t    stage3_cn_gt_0_8_models: 4\n815\t    overlap_lz_and_cn: 3\n816\t    ppc_mean_residual: 0.02\n817\t    ppc_95pct_residuals_in_band: 91.5\n818\t    divergent_transitions_total: 12\n819\t    divergent_transitions_pct: 0.075\n820\t    trace_quality_theta: good\n821\t    trace_quality_c_n: adequate with slow mixing for 2 models\n822\t  result_rationale: 'Median档下model fit \"works but not perfectly\"。 θ的infit/outfit大部分在[0.7,\n823\t    1.3]可接受范围，2个models misfitting（可能是能力profile异常的模型， 如specialized coding model在非coding\n824\t    items上表现与Rasch unidimensionality不符）。 c_n的fit较差（3个misfitting），因为rank-1 assumption\n825\t    (c_n·e_i) 对某些models是approximate： 部分models的contamination pattern可能不proportional\n826\t    to item exposure， 但MNSQ < 1.5说明misfit不severe enough to invalidate model。 Person-fit\n827\t    comparison（Stage 1 lz vs Stage 3 c_n）显示3/4 overlap—— Stage 1检测为\"anomalous\"的模型在Stage\n828\t    3被identified as contaminated， 这提供了construct coherence validation（contamination\n829\t    IS the source of person misfit）。 PPC 91.5%的residuals in 95% band略低于ideal（95%），12个divergent\n830\t    transitions (0.075%) 在可接受范围但提示c_n posterior geometry有局部困难。\n831\t\n832\t    '\n833\t  tables:\n834\t  - name: 'Table 10: Facet Fit Summary (Infit/Outfit MNSQ)'\n835\t    columns:\n836\t    - Facet\n837\t    - N\n838\t    - Infit Range\n839\t    - Outfit Range\n840\t    - Misfitting (>1.3 or <0.7)\n841\t    - '% Misfitting'\n842\t    sample_rows:\n843\t    - - θ (model ability)\n844\t      - '22'\n845\t      - '[0.72, 1.35]'\n846\t      - '[0.68, 1.42]'\n847\t      - '2'\n848\t      - 9.1%\n849\t    - - b (item difficulty)\n850\t      - '180'\n851\t      - '[0.78, 1.28]'\n852\t      - '[0.75, 1.32]'\n853\t      - '5'\n854\t      - 2.8%\n855\t    - - d (judge severity)\n856\t      - '8'\n857\t      - '[0.82, 1.22]'\n858\t      - '[0.80, 1.25]'\n859\t      - '1'\n860\t      - 12.5%\n861\t    - - c (contamination)\n862\t      - '22'\n863\t      - '[0.65, 1.48]'\n864\t      - '[0.62, 1.55]'\n865\t      - '3'\n866\t      - 13.6%\n867\t  - name: 'Table S7: Person-Fit Cross-Validation'\n868\t    columns:\n869\t    - Model\n870\t    - Stage 1 lz\n871\t    - Stage 1 Flag?\n872\t    - Stage 3 c_n\n873\t    - Stage 3 c_n > 0.8?\n874\t    note: 3 of 4 lz-flagged models also have c_n > 0.8, supporting construct coherence.\n875\t  figures_description:\n876\t  - 'Fig S7: Infit/Outfit MNSQ Wright Map for all facets.'\n877\t  - 'Fig S8: Posterior predictive check — observed vs predicted score distributions.'\n878\t  - 'Fig S9: Trace plots for c_n of 4 highest-contamination models.'\n879\t  - 'Fig S10: Stage 1 person-fit (lz) vs Stage 3 c_n scatter plot.'\n880\t  analysis: 'Overall model fit acceptable for a novel psychometric model on real LLM\n881\t    evaluation data. c_n facet的fit稍弱是预期内的——rank-1 assumption是simplification， 但misfit程度（MNSQ\n882\t    < 1.5）不足以reject model。 Person-fit cross-validation（3/4 overlap）是一个强validation\n883\t    signal， 可在paper中作为\"contamination构念效度\"的证据。 Limitations应讨论c_n misfitting models和rank-1\n884\t    assumption的局限性。\n885\t\n886\t    '\n887\t- name: confounding_formal_observation\n888\t  plan_id: exp-009\n889\t  description: 'Formal bias analysis + Monte Carlo validation + synthetic c_n recovery。\n890\t    Frame as Observation (standard OVB)。\n891\t\n892\t    '\n893\t  expected_results:\n894\t    bias_direction: sign(Cov(d_j, c_n·e_i)) determines bias direction\n895\t    bias_magnitude_first_order: O(σ_d · σ_c · ρ_{d,c·e})\n896\t    mc_rho_0_theta_rmse_sequential: 0.155\n897\t    mc_rho_0_theta_rmse_joint: 0.15\n898\t    mc_rho_0_3_theta_rmse_sequential: 0.168\n899\t    mc_rho_0_3_theta_rmse_joint: 0.148\n900\t    mc_rho_0_6_theta_rmse_sequential: 0.198\n901\t    mc_rho_0_6_theta_rmse_joint: 0.145\n902\t    mc_rho_0_6_degradation_pct: 36.6\n903\t    c_n_recovery_rmse_c_low: 0.12\n904\t    c_n_recovery_rmse_c_moderate: 0.22\n905\t    c_n_recovery_rmse_c_high: 0.18\n906\t    c_n_95ci_coverage_overall: 0.88\n907\t    c_n_95ci_coverage_c_gt_0_8: 0.82\n908\t    c_n_mean_bias: 0.03\n909\t  result_rationale: 'Monte Carlo在ρ=0时两方法RMSE接近（无confounding → no advantage）， 但ρ=0.6时sequential的RMSE升36.6%——低于mvp_003的43.8%因为此Monte\n910\t    Carlo 使用更realistic的moderate contamination parameters（c_n ~ mvp_001 level而非mvp_003）。\n911\t    c_n recovery RMSE在moderate contamination regime为0.22，落在[0.15, 0.3]范围—— moderate\n912\t    contamination比strong contamination更难recover（信号弱）， 但比very weak contamination更容易（有足够信号区分contaminated\n913\t    vs clean）。 95% CI coverage 88% < nominal 95%，说明posterior略under-covers， 主要因为staged\n914\t    estimation（e_i fixed）低估了total uncertainty——这是honest limitation。 c_n > 0.8的coverage更低（82%），因为high-c_n\n915\t    models的posterior更sensitive to e_i error。\n916\t\n917\t    '\n918\t  tables:\n919\t  - name: 'Table 1: Sequential vs Joint Estimation Under Confounding (Monte Carlo)'\n920\t    columns:\n921\t    - ρ(d,c·e)\n922\t    - θ-RMSE Sequential\n923\t    - θ-RMSE Joint\n924\t    - Degradation %\n925\t    - p-value\n926\t    sample_rows:\n927\t    - - '0.0'\n928\t      - 0.155±0.024\n929\t      - 0.150±0.026\n930\t      - 3.3%\n931\t      - '0.42'\n932\t    - - '0.1'\n933\t      - 0.158±0.025\n934\t      - 0.149±0.025\n935\t      - 6.0%\n936\t      - '0.31'\n937\t    - - '0.3'\n938\t      - 0.168±0.027\n939\t      - 0.148±0.024\n940\t      - 13.5%\n941\t      - '0.04'\n942\t    - - '0.6'\n943\t      - 0.198±0.031\n944\t      - 0.145±0.023\n945\t      - 36.6%\n946\t      - < 0.001\n947\t    - - '0.9'\n948\t      - 0.265±0.042\n949\t      - 0.142±0.022\n950\t      - 86.6%\n951\t      - < 0.001\n952\t  - name: 'Table S1: Synthetic c_n Recovery'\n953\t    columns:\n954\t    - True c_n Range\n955\t    - N Models\n956\t    - Recovery RMSE\n957\t    - Mean Bias\n958\t    - 95% CI Coverage\n959\t    sample_rows:\n960\t    - - '[0, 0.3)'\n961\t      - '7'\n962\t      - '0.12'\n963\t      - '+0.02'\n964\t      - 92%\n965\t    - - '[0.3, 0.8)'\n966\t      - '9'\n967\t      - '0.22'\n968\t      - '+0.03'\n969\t      - 88%\n970\t    - - '[0.8, 1.5]'\n971\t      - '4'\n972\t      - '0.18'\n973\t      - '+0.05'\n974\t      - 82%\n975\t    - - Overall\n976\t      - '20'\n977\t      - '0.19'\n978\t      - '+0.03'\n979\t      - 88%\n980\t  figures_description:\n981\t  - 'Fig 1 (Section 2): Toy example showing confounding mechanism. Left: sequential\n982\t    pipeline with bias arrows. Right: G-MFRM joint estimation.'\n983\t  - 'Fig S1: θ-RMSE vs ρ curves for sequential (rising) and joint (flat), clearly\n984\t    showing confounding sensitivity.'\n985\t  - 'Fig S2: c_n scatter (true vs recovered) with 45° reference line and 95% CI bands.'\n986\t  analysis: 'Observation成立：sequential estimator的bias随confounding strength单调增加， joint\n987\t    estimator对confounding robust。Moderate contamination regime（median档）下， sequential\n988\t    degradation ~13-37%（取决于ρ），G-MFRM consistently better。 c_n recovery RMSE=0.22支持\"G-MFRM\n989\t    can meaningfully estimate contamination\"但 coverage < 95%是honest limitation。 Paper\n990\t    Section 2应lead with这个Observation + toy example figure作为motivation。\n991\t\n992\t    '\n993\t- name: error_propagation_sensitivity\n994\t  plan_id: exp-012\n995\t  description: 'Staged estimation的error propagation：向e_i注入σ=0.1/0.2/0.5的Gaussian noise，\n996\t    测量θ̂ RMSE degradation和c_n recovery accuracy。\n997\t\n998\t    '\n999\t  expected_results:\n1000\t    theta_rmse_sigma_0_0: 0.145\n1001\t    theta_rmse_sigma_0_1: 0.152\n1002\t    theta_rmse_sigma_0_2: 0.168\n1003\t    theta_rmse_sigma_0_5: 0.225\n1004\t    theta_rmse_degradation_sigma_0_1_pct: 4.8\n1005\t    theta_rmse_degradation_sigma_0_2_pct: 15.9\n1006\t    theta_rmse_degradation_sigma_0_5_pct: 55.2\n1007\t    c_n_rmse_sigma_0_0: 0.19\n1008\t    c_n_rmse_sigma_0_1: 0.22\n1009\t    c_n_rmse_sigma_0_2: 0.3\n1010\t    c_n_rmse_sigma_0_5: 0.52\n1011\t    still_beats_sequential_sigma_0_1: true\n1012\t    still_beats_sequential_sigma_0_2: true\n1013\t    still_beats_sequential_sigma_0_5: false\n1014\t    breakeven_sigma: 0.38\n1015\t  result_rationale: 'Median档假设σ=0.2时degradation在[5%, 15%]范围。预测15.9%接近上界， 因为moderate\n1016\t    contamination下θ̂对e_i noise更sensitive—— 当c_n本身较小时，e_i的noise相对于c_n·e_i signal的比例更大。\n1017\t    σ=0.1时degradation ~5%（可接受），σ=0.5时degradation ~55%（不可接受，method breaks down）。 Breakeven\n1018\t    point σ≈0.38：e_i noise超过此阈值时G-MFRM不再优于sequential。 这是Tier B narrative的重要组成部分——staged\n1019\t    estimation在reasonable e_i quality下robust， 但有clear failure mode。Paper Limitations必须讨论。\n1020\t    c_n recovery RMSE的degradation更steep（0.19→0.52 at σ=0.5）， 因为c_n directly depends\n1021\t    on e_i through gating mechanism。\n1022\t\n1023\t    '\n1024\t  tables:\n1025\t  - name: 'Table 11: Error Propagation Sensitivity (Synthetic)'\n1026\t    columns:\n1027\t    - e_i Noise σ\n1028\t    - θ̂ RMSE\n1029\t    - Degradation %\n1030\t    - c_n RMSE\n1031\t    - Beats Sequential?\n1032\t    - p vs Sequential\n1033\t    sample_rows:\n1034\t    - - 0.0 (oracle)\n1035\t      - '0.145'\n1036\t      - —\n1037\t      - '0.19'\n1038\t      - 'Yes'\n1039\t      - < 0.001\n1040\t    - - '0.1'\n1041\t      - '0.152'\n1042\t      - 4.8%\n1043\t      - '0.22'\n1044\t      - 'Yes'\n1045\t      - < 0.001\n1046\t    - - '0.2'\n1047\t      - '0.168'\n1048\t      - 15.9%\n1049\t      - '0.30'\n1050\t      - 'Yes'\n1051\t      - '0.02'\n1052\t    - - '0.3'\n1053\t      - '0.192'\n1054\t      - 32.4%\n1055\t      - '0.39'\n1056\t      - Marginal\n1057\t      - '0.08'\n1058\t    - - '0.5'\n1059\t      - '0.225'\n1060\t      - 55.2%\n1061\t      - '0.52'\n1062\t      - 'No'\n1063\t      - '0.35'\n1064\t  - name: 'Table S8: Breakeven Analysis'\n1065\t    columns:\n1066\t    - Metric\n1067\t    - Value\n1068\t    sample_rows:\n1069\t    - - Breakeven σ (G-MFRM τ = Sequential τ)\n1070\t      - '0.38'\n1071\t    - - Estimated real e_i pipeline σ\n1072\t      - 0.15–0.20\n1073\t    - - Safety margin\n1074\t      - 1.9–2.5×\n1075\t  figures_description:\n1076\t  - 'Fig 12: θ̂ RMSE vs e_i noise σ, with sequential baseline as horizontal dashed\n1077\t    line. Intersection at σ≈0.38.'\n1078\t  - 'Fig S11: c_n recovery scatter plots at each noise level, showing increasing dispersion.'\n1079\t  analysis: 'Staged estimation在realistic noise levels下robust（safety margin ~2×）， 但不是unconditionally\n1080\t    robust。σ=0.2时degradation 15.9%处于acceptable-but-noticeable range。 Breakeven σ=0.38\n1081\t    vs estimated real pipeline σ=0.15-0.20 gives safety margin of ~2×。 This directly\n1082\t    addresses Reviewer Concern #4b和Dream R1-N1： staged estimation是principled且empirically\n1083\t    robust，但paper必须state the limitation clearly。\n1084\t\n1085\t    '\n1086\t- name: wildbench_replication\n1087\t  plan_id: exp-010\n1088\t  description: 'WildBench上复现G-MFRM pipeline作为第三个benchmark。Cross-benchmark generalization。\n1089\t\n1090\t    '\n1091\t  expected_results:\n1092\t    wildbench_num_items: 1024\n1093\t    wildbench_num_judges_used: 6\n1094\t    tau_raw_average: 0.76\n1095\t    tau_mfrm_only: 0.79\n1096\t    tau_sequential: 0.81\n1097\t    tau_cyclicjudge_discard: 0.82\n1098\t    tau_gmfrm: 0.84\n1099\t    delta_tau_vs_best_baseline: 0.02\n1100\t    c_n_median_wildbench: 0.38\n1101\t    c_n_correlation_with_mtbench: 0.72\n1102\t    convergence_max_rhat: 1.09\n1103\t    convergence_min_ess: 108\n1104\t    wilcoxon_gmfrm_vs_best_p: 0.065\n1105\t  result_rationale: 'WildBench的contamination预期更低（c_n median=0.38 vs MT-Bench 0.48），\n1106\t    因为WildBench items更diverse且更新更频繁。 6个judges（cost constraint）接近minimum threshold（exp-006预测5个为拐点），\n1107\t    所以convergence和performance都marginal worse than MT-Bench/Arena-Hard。 Δτ=+0.02 vs\n1108\t    best baseline，p=0.065——again borderline，consistent with median档。 Cross-benchmark\n1109\t    c_n correlation r=0.72说明contamination是model-level trait （某些模型consistently contaminated\n1110\t    across benchmarks），这是有价值的diagnostic insight。 WildBench主要价值是generalization evidence，即使improvement\n1111\t    modest。\n1112\t\n1113\t    '\n1114\t  tables:\n1115\t  - name: 'Table S9: WildBench Results'\n1116\t    columns:\n1117\t    - Method\n1118\t    - Kendall-τ\n1119\t    - Spearman-ρ\n1120\t    - p vs G-MFRM\n1121\t    sample_rows:\n1122\t    - - Raw Average\n1123\t      - '0.76'\n1124\t      - '0.80'\n1125\t      - '0.003'\n1126\t    - - Sequential\n1127\t      - '0.81'\n1128\t      - '0.85'\n1129\t      - '0.031'\n1130\t    - - CyclicJudge+Discard\n1131\t      - '0.82'\n1132\t      - '0.86'\n1133\t      - '0.065'\n1134\t    - - '**G-MFRM**'\n1135\t      - '**0.84**'\n1136\t      - '**0.88**'\n1137\t      - —\n1138\t  figures_description:\n1139\t  - 'Fig S12: Cross-benchmark c_n correlation scatter (MT-Bench c_n vs WildBench c_n),\n1140\t    r=0.72.'\n1141\t  analysis: 'WildBench replication确认G-MFRM在第三个benchmark上也numerically best，但advantage同样modest。\n1142\t    Cross-benchmark c_n correlation是strong secondary finding： contamination susceptibility\n1143\t    is a model property, not a benchmark artifact—— strengthens the case for per-model\n1144\t    contamination audit as diagnostic tool。 Whether to include in main paper depends\n1145\t    on page budget；可放appendix if space-constrained。\n1146\t\n1147\t    '\n1148\t- name: adversarial_robustness\n1149\t  plan_id: exp-011\n1150\t  description: '按Wang et al. (ICLR 2026) fragility findings测试G-MFRM robustness。\n1151\t\n1152\t    '\n1153\t  expected_results:\n1154\t    scenario_judge_collusion_tau_drop: 0.04\n1155\t    scenario_strategic_contamination_tau_drop: 0.06\n1156\t    scenario_item_poisoning_tau_drop: 0.03\n1157\t    baseline_sequential_collusion_tau_drop: 0.07\n1158\t    baseline_cyclicjudge_collusion_tau_drop: 0.05\n1159\t    gmfrm_detects_collusion_via_d_j_outlier: true\n1160\t    gmfrm_detects_strategic_contam_via_c_n_pattern: partially\n1161\t    gmfrm_more_robust_than_baselines: mixed — more robust to judge collusion, similarly\n1162\t      vulnerable to strategic contamination\n1163\t  result_rationale: 'Median档下adversarial robustness预期为mixed results。 Judge collusion（部分judges协调inflate某模型）：G-MFRM的multi-facet\n1164\t    estimation比sequential更robust （Δτ drop 0.04 vs 0.07），因为d_j estimation可以部分absorb\n1165\t    coordinated judge behavior。 Strategic contamination（模型deliberately leak but hide\n1166\t    signals）：G-MFRM与baselines similarly vulnerable （Δτ drop 0.06），因为e_i estimation依赖performance\n1167\t    gap，deliberate obfuscation可以defeat this signal。 但G-MFRM的diagnostic outputs（d_j\n1168\t    outlier detection）提供了detection capability其他方法没有。 这是P2 experiment——如果space允许放入paper，主要价值是demonstrates\n1169\t    diagnostic use case。\n1170\t\n1171\t    '\n1172\t  tables:\n1173\t  - name: 'Table S10: Adversarial Robustness'\n1174\t    columns:\n1175\t    - Scenario\n1176\t    - G-MFRM τ Drop\n1177\t    - Sequential τ Drop\n1178\t    - CyclicJudge τ Drop\n1179\t    - G-MFRM Detects?\n1180\t    sample_rows:\n1181\t    - - Judge Collusion (2/8 judges)\n1182\t      - −0.04\n1183\t      - −0.07\n1184\t      - −0.05\n1185\t      - Yes (d_j outlier)\n1186\t    - - Strategic Contamination\n1187\t      - −0.06\n1188\t      - −0.06\n1189\t      - −0.06\n1190\t      - Partial (c_n pattern)\n1191\t    - - Item Poisoning (10% items)\n1192\t      - −0.03\n1193\t      - −0.04\n1194\t      - −0.03\n1195\t      - Yes (infit outlier)\n1196\t  figures_description:\n1197\t  - 'Fig S13: τ degradation under each adversarial scenario, comparing methods.'\n1198\t  analysis: G-MFRM不是adversarially robust的silver bullet，但diagnostic outputs提供了detection\n1199\t    capability。 Judge collusion detection通过d_j outlier是实际可行的——这是\"judge selection guidance\"贡献的具体体现。\n1200\t    Paper中如果include，应framing为\"G-MFRM's diagnostic outputs enable detection of evaluation\n1201\t    manipulation\"， 而非\"G-MFRM is robust to adversarial attack\"。\n1202\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"bec27a47-b105-4d84-852b-071ff9cc9e47","uuid":"00590234-3488-48bd-b2b2-8f918ea300c2","timestamp":"2026-05-21T22:31:32.429Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-prod43/projects/gated_mfrm_judge_bias/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260521T215715/median/review_context.yaml","content":"narrative_guidance: 'Tier B narrative. Real contamination is detectable but moderate\n  (c_n median ~0.5). G-MFRM ranking improvement over best baselines is statistically\n  significant but practically modest (+2-3pp Kendall-τ). Pivot primary contribution\n  to diagnostic/interpretability outputs: per-model c_n as training data audit tool,\n  per-item e_i for item retirement decisions, per-judge d_j for judge selection guidance.\n  Lead argument: ''Sequential methods provide no visibility into whether corrections\n  are needed — G-MFRM provides both correction and diagnosis.'' Forward-looking: as\n  contamination grows, joint estimation becomes critical. May need exp-010 (WildBench)\n  to strengthen empirical package with a third benchmark.\n\n  '\nimagined_experiments:\n- name: multi_judge_data_collection\n  plan_id: exp-001\n  description: 'Collect multi-judge evaluation data on MT-Bench and Arena-Hard using\n    8 judges. 20+ target models evaluated with position swap.\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    num_judges: 8\n    num_target_models: 22\n    benchmarks:\n    - MT-Bench\n    - Arena-Hard\n    total_judgments_mt_bench: 28160\n    total_judgments_arena_hard: 35200\n    position_bias_detected_judges: 3\n    api_cost_usd: 820\n    gpu_hours_used: 118\n    missing_data_pct: 2.1\n    inter_judge_agreement_fleiss_kappa: 0.38\n  result_rationale: 'Median档下，8个judge的评分会展现出中等程度的一致性（Fleiss κ~0.38），反映了judge之间severity差异的真实存在。\n    22个target model覆盖了从GPT-5.5到开源7B模型的能力梯度，确保contamination susceptibility的变异性。 Position\n    bias在3个judge上显著（主要是较小的开源judge），这为d_j估计提供了必要的judge间变异。 缺失数据约2%来自API超时和vLLM偶发OOM，在可接受范围内。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table A1: Judge × Benchmark Data Collection Summary'\n    columns:\n    - Judge\n    - MT-Bench Items\n    - Arena-Hard Items\n    - Position Swap\n    - Missing %\n    - Mean Score\n    sample_rows:\n    - - GPT-5.5\n      - 1760\n      - 2200\n      - 'Yes'\n      - 0.0%\n      - '7.82'\n    - - Claude Opus 4.7\n      - 1760\n      - 2200\n      - 'Yes'\n      - 0.0%\n      - '7.45'\n    - - Claude Sonnet 4.6\n      - 1760\n      - 2200\n      - 'Yes'\n      - 0.0%\n      - '7.61'\n    - - DeepSeek-V4-Pro\n      - 1760\n      - 2200\n      - 'Yes'\n      - 1.8%\n      - '7.28'\n    - - Qwen3-235B-A22B\n      - 1760\n      - 2200\n      - 'Yes'\n      - 2.5%\n      - '7.15'\n    - - Qwen3.6-27B\n      - 1760\n      - 2200\n      - 'Yes'\n      - 4.2%\n      - '6.93'\n    - - Llama 4 Maverick\n      - 1760\n      - 2200\n      - 'Yes'\n      - 3.1%\n      - '7.05'\n    - - Gemma3-27B\n      - 1760\n      - 2200\n      - 'Yes'\n      - 2.8%\n      - '6.88'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig S1: Judge score distribution heatmap (judge × target model), showing systematic\n    severity differences across judges.'\n  analysis: '数据收集本身不直接验证claim，但数据质量决定了后续实验的上限。 Judge间score分布差异（mean range: 6.88–7.82）确认了judge\n    severity变异的存在，为d_j估计提供信号。 中等的inter-judge agreement (κ~0.38) 意味着judge bias correction有实际意义。\n\n    '\n- name: item_exposure_estimation\n  plan_id: exp-002\n  description: '三源pipeline估计per-item exposure e_i。Primary source: 原始vs改写变体的performance\n    gap； Temporal: pre/post-cutoff变体gap；LogProber: token logprob memorization scores。\n    加权组合后用ConStat per-model delta做外部验证。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    num_items_mt_bench: 80\n    num_items_arena_hard: 100\n    reference_variants_created: 180\n    primary_source_coverage: 1.0\n    temporal_source_coverage: 0.45\n    logprober_source_coverage: 0.55\n    composite_e_i_mean: 0.32\n    composite_e_i_std: 0.21\n    composite_e_i_range:\n    - 0.0\n    - 0.82\n    high_exposure_items_pct: 18.0\n    primary_temporal_correlation: 0.58\n    primary_logprober_correlation: 0.41\n    weighted_composite_internal_consistency_alpha: 0.62\n    constat_cn_vs_gmfrm_cn_spearman: 0.52\n  result_rationale: 'Median档假设real contamination moderate，因此e_i分布右偏但不极端：大部分items（~82%）的e_i\n    < 0.5， 仅少数items（~18%）有明显的contamination exposure。这与\"contamination exists but is\n    moderate\"一致。 Primary source（performance gap）覆盖率100%且信号最强；temporal source覆盖率有限（仅45%的items有\n    pre/post-cutoff变体），但与primary的相关性中等（r=0.58）。LogProber覆盖率55%（仅有logprob API的模型），\n    且与primary相关性较弱（r=0.41）——这是median档的关键特征之一：\"one source contributes little\"。 内部一致性α=0.62反映了三源信号的中等coherence，足以构建可用的composite但不overwhelming。\n    ConStat验证ρ=0.52落在[0.4, 0.7)范围内，表明fitted c_n与外部contamination measure有中等agreement。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 2: Exposure Indicator Source Comparison'\n    columns:\n    - Source\n    - Coverage\n    - Mean e_i\n    - Std\n    - Correlation w/ Composite\n    sample_rows:\n    - - Primary (performance gap)\n      - 100%\n      - '0.30'\n      - '0.22'\n      - '0.91'\n    - - Temporal (pre/post cutoff)\n      - 45%\n      - '0.35'\n      - '0.25'\n      - '0.72'\n    - - LogProber (logprob)\n      - 55%\n      - '0.28'\n      - '0.19'\n      - '0.58'\n    - - Weighted Composite\n      - 100%\n      - '0.32'\n      - '0.21'\n      - '1.00'\n  - name: 'Table S2: High-Exposure Items (e_i > 0.5)'\n    columns:\n    - Benchmark\n    - Item ID\n    - e_i\n    - Primary\n    - Temporal\n    - LogProber\n    - Category\n    note: ~32 items total (18% of 180). Concentrated in coding and math categories.\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 2(a): e_i histogram across all items, showing right-skewed distribution with\n    mode near 0.15 and tail to 0.82.'\n  - 'Fig 2(b): Source-pair scatter plots (primary vs temporal, primary vs LogProber)\n    with regression lines.'\n  - 'Fig S2: Per-benchmark e_i distribution comparison (MT-Bench vs Arena-Hard).'\n  analysis: 'e_i pipeline产生合理的exposure estimates，但LogProber贡献有限。这意味着在ablation（exp-007）中，\n    去除LogProber对composite质量影响较小，2/3 sources sufficient。 MT-Bench的coding/math items的e_i系统性高于reasoning/writing\n    items， 与contamination通过training data leakage的机制一致。 Arena-Hard的e_i整体略低于MT-Bench，可能因Arena-Hard更新更频繁、泄露窗口更短。\n\n    '\n- name: gmfrm_real_data_fit\n  plan_id: exp-003\n  description: '在exp-001/002的real data上拟合G-MFRM三阶段pipeline。 Stage 1: MFRM估计(θ,b,d)。Stage\n    2: 固定exp-002的e_i。Stage 3: Joint gated model。 输出fair scores θ̂并与Chatbot Arena Elo对比。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    stage1_max_rhat: 1.02\n    stage1_min_ess: 380\n    stage3_max_rhat: 1.07\n    stage3_min_ess: 142\n    stage3_divergent_transitions: 12\n    theta_range:\n    - -1.8\n    - 2.1\n    d_j_range:\n    - -0.62\n    - 0.48\n    d_j_std: 0.31\n    c_n_median: 0.48\n    c_n_mean: 0.54\n    c_n_range:\n    - 0.05\n    - 1.35\n    c_n_gt_0_3_count: 13\n    c_n_gt_0_8_count: 4\n    kendall_tau_arena_mt_bench: 0.87\n    kendall_tau_arena_arena_hard: 0.86\n    spearman_rho_arena_mt_bench: 0.91\n    spearman_rho_arena_arena_hard: 0.9\n    arena_hard_subset_low_contamination_tau_gmfrm: 0.88\n    arena_hard_subset_low_contamination_tau_mfrm: 0.87\n    runtime_seconds: 8400\n    mcmc_warmup: 2000\n    mcmc_samples: 4000\n    mcmc_chains: 4\n  result_rationale: 'Median档的核心特征在此实验集中体现。c_n median=0.48落在[0.3, 0.8)区间， 接近mvp_001的weak\n    contamination而非mvp_003的strong contamination。 22个模型中13个有c_n > 0.3（moderate），仅4个有c_n\n    > 0.8（heavy）， 说明contamination普遍存在但幅度有限。 Stage 3收敛需要调优：R̂=1.07（≤1.10但不ideal）、ESS=142（≥100但远低于mvp_003的224），\n    12个divergent transitions提示geometry有困难但未破坏inference。 这是因为moderate contamination意味着c_n的posterior更diffuse（数据对c_n的约束力较弱），\n    MCMC更难探索。Kendall-τ=0.87落在[0.84, 0.9]范围，比raw average显著提升但不dramatic。 低contamination子集上G-MFRM与MFRM几乎无差异（0.88\n    vs 0.87），确认graceful degradation。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 3: G-MFRM Convergence Diagnostics'\n    columns:\n    - Parameter Group\n    - Max R̂\n    - Min ESS\n    - Mean ESS\n    - Divergent Transitions\n    sample_rows:\n    - - θ (model ability)\n      - '1.03'\n      - '285'\n      - '420'\n      - '0'\n    - - b (item difficulty)\n      - '1.02'\n      - '310'\n      - '465'\n      - '0'\n    - - d (judge severity)\n      - '1.02'\n      - '340'\n      - '490'\n      - '0'\n    - - c (contamination)\n      - '1.07'\n      - '142'\n      - '215'\n      - '12'\n  - name: 'Table 4: Per-Model Parameter Estimates (sorted by θ̂)'\n    columns:\n    - Model\n    - θ̂ (fair)\n    - θ_raw\n    - c_n\n    - c_n 95%CI\n    - Rank_fair\n    - Rank_raw\n    - Δ Rank\n    sample_rows:\n    - - GPT-5.5\n      - '1.95'\n      - '2.08'\n      - '0.72'\n      - '[0.38, 1.12]'\n      - '1'\n      - '1'\n      - '0'\n    - - Claude Opus 4.7\n      - '1.82'\n      - '1.85'\n      - '0.21'\n      - '[0.03, 0.52]'\n      - '2'\n      - '3'\n      - '+1'\n    - - DeepSeek-V4-Pro\n      - '1.71'\n      - '1.92'\n      - '1.15'\n      - '[0.68, 1.35]'\n      - '3'\n      - '2'\n      - '-1'\n    - - Qwen3-235B-A22B\n      - '1.45'\n      - '1.58'\n      - '0.65'\n      - '[0.31, 1.02]'\n      - '5'\n      - '4'\n      - '-1'\n    - - Model-X-70B\n      - '0.85'\n      - '1.10'\n      - '1.28'\n      - '[0.85, 1.35]'\n      - '10'\n      - '7'\n      - '-3'\n    - - Small-7B-Chat\n      - '-1.52'\n      - '-1.48'\n      - '0.08'\n      - '[0.01, 0.28]'\n      - '22'\n      - '22'\n      - '0'\n  - name: 'Table S3: Per-Judge Severity Estimates'\n    columns:\n    - Judge\n    - d_j\n    - d_j 95%CI\n    - Interpretation\n    sample_rows:\n    - - GPT-5.5\n      - '-0.15'\n      - '[-0.32, 0.02]'\n      - Slightly lenient\n    - - Claude Opus 4.7\n      - '0.08'\n      - '[-0.10, 0.25]'\n      - Near neutral\n    - - Qwen3.6-27B\n      - '0.48'\n      - '[0.28, 0.68]'\n      - Most severe\n    - - Llama 4 Maverick\n      - '-0.62'\n      - '[-0.85, -0.40]'\n      - Most lenient\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 3: Scatter plot of θ̂_fair vs Chatbot Arena Elo, colored by c_n magnitude.\n    High-c_n models pulled downward relative to raw scores.'\n  - 'Fig 4: c_n posterior density plots for all 22 models, ordered by posterior median.\n    Shows moderate contamination landscape.'\n  - 'Fig S3: Trace plots for c_n of 4 highest-contamination models, showing adequate\n    mixing despite slower convergence.'\n  - 'Fig S4: θ̂_raw vs θ̂_fair with identity line; deviations annotated with model\n    names.'\n  analysis: 'G-MFRM成功拟合real data，收敛可接受但不完美（c_n的ESS偏低）。 c_n median=0.48确认了median档预期：contamination存在且可量化，但幅度moderate。\n    关键发现：4个模型（DeepSeek-V4-Pro, Qwen3-235B-A22B, Model-X-70B, 另一个）的c_n > 0.8， 这些模型的fair\n    score显著低于raw score，产生了有意义的rank changes。 但top-5整体稳定（仅1-2个位置变动），限制了ranking correction的headline\n    impact。 Per-judge d_j range（-0.62 to 0.48）确认judge severity差异显著， 为\"judge selection\n    guidance\"这一diagnostic贡献提供了直接证据。\n\n    '\n- name: baseline_comparison\n  plan_id: exp-004\n  description: 'G-MFRM vs 8条baselines在相同数据上对比。 包含rank change analysis：具体哪些模型换位、换多少位、top-k稳定性。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    tau_raw_average: 0.79\n    tau_mfrm_only: 0.82\n    tau_sequential: 0.84\n    tau_cyclicjudge: 0.83\n    tau_cyclicjudge_discard: 0.85\n    tau_dcr_factor: 0.81\n    tau_uda: 0.84\n    tau_pref_leakage_cal: 0.82\n    tau_gmfrm: 0.87\n    rho_raw_average: 0.83\n    rho_mfrm_only: 0.86\n    rho_sequential: 0.88\n    rho_cyclicjudge: 0.87\n    rho_cyclicjudge_discard: 0.89\n    rho_dcr_factor: 0.85\n    rho_uda: 0.88\n    rho_pref_leakage_cal: 0.86\n    rho_gmfrm: 0.91\n    tau_gmfrm_arena_hard: 0.86\n    tau_best_baseline_arena_hard: 0.84\n    delta_tau_vs_best_baseline_mt_bench: 0.02\n    delta_tau_vs_best_baseline_arena_hard: 0.02\n    wilcoxon_gmfrm_vs_cyclicjudge_discard_p: 0.073\n    wilcoxon_gmfrm_vs_sequential_p: 0.018\n    wilcoxon_gmfrm_vs_raw_p: 0.001\n    rank_changes_ge2_positions: 2\n    top5_stability_raw_vs_gmfrm: 4/5 same\n    top10_stability_raw_vs_gmfrm: 7/10 same\n    max_rank_change_model: Model-X-70B\n    max_rank_change_positions: 3\n  result_rationale: 'Median档的核心tension在此实验体现：G-MFRM beats all baselines但margin modest。\n    Δτ=+0.02 vs CyclicJudge+discard（best baseline），p=0.073——borderline significant。\n    这是因为moderate contamination意味着contamination correction的marginal value有限： CyclicJudge+discard已经通过丢弃high-exposure\n    items移除了大部分contamination signal， G-MFRM的优势在于保留这些items的information（不丢弃）而非dramatically改变ranking。\n    vs sequential (p=0.018) 和 vs raw (p=0.001) 则显著，因为这些baseline完全不处理contamination。\n    Rank changes limited to 2个models移动≥2位，最大移动3位（Model-X-70B: raw rank 7→fair rank\n    10）， top-5有4/5不变——这限制了\"G-MFRM dramatically corrects rankings\"的narrative， 但支持\"G-MFRM\n    provides correction where needed + diagnostic visibility everywhere\"的Tier B framing。\n    UDA的τ=0.84与sequential持平，说明neural K-factor adjustment在有contamination时也受confounding影响。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 5: Main Results — Agreement with Chatbot Arena Human Votes'\n    columns:\n    - Method\n    - MT-Bench τ\n    - MT-Bench ρ\n    - Arena-Hard τ\n    - Arena-Hard ρ\n    - p vs G-MFRM\n    sample_rows:\n    - - Raw Multi-Judge Avg\n      - '0.79'\n      - '0.83'\n      - '0.78'\n      - '0.82'\n      - '0.001'\n    - - MFRM-only\n      - '0.82'\n      - '0.86'\n      - '0.81'\n      - '0.85'\n      - '0.009'\n    - - Sequential Pipeline\n      - '0.84'\n      - '0.88'\n      - '0.83'\n      - '0.87'\n      - '0.018'\n    - - CyclicJudge\n      - '0.83'\n      - '0.87'\n      - '0.82'\n      - '0.86'\n      - '0.025'\n    - - CyclicJudge + Discard\n      - '0.85'\n      - '0.89'\n      - '0.84'\n      - '0.88'\n      - '0.073'\n    - - DCR Factor\n      - '0.81'\n      - '0.85'\n      - '0.80'\n      - '0.84'\n      - '0.005'\n    - - UDA\n      - '0.84'\n      - '0.88'\n      - '0.83'\n      - '0.87'\n      - '0.021'\n    - - Pref. Leakage Cal.\n      - '0.82'\n      - '0.86'\n      - '0.81'\n      - '0.85'\n      - '0.008'\n    - - '**G-MFRM (ours)**'\n      - '**0.87**'\n      - '**0.91**'\n      - '**0.86**'\n      - '**0.90**'\n      - —\n  - name: 'Table 6: Rank Change Analysis (G-MFRM Fair vs Raw Average)'\n    columns:\n    - Model\n    - Raw Rank\n    - G-MFRM Rank\n    - Δ Rank\n    - c_n\n    - Moved ≥2?\n    sample_rows:\n    - - GPT-5.5\n      - '1'\n      - '1'\n      - '0'\n      - '0.72'\n      - 'No'\n    - - DeepSeek-V4-Pro\n      - '2'\n      - '3'\n      - '-1'\n      - '1.15'\n      - 'No'\n    - - Claude Opus 4.7\n      - '3'\n      - '2'\n      - '+1'\n      - '0.21'\n      - 'No'\n    - - Qwen3-235B-A22B\n      - '4'\n      - '5'\n      - '-1'\n      - '0.65'\n      - 'No'\n    - - Model-Y-Pro\n      - '6'\n      - '4'\n      - '+2'\n      - '0.12'\n      - 'Yes'\n    - - Model-X-70B\n      - '7'\n      - '10'\n      - '-3'\n      - '1.28'\n      - 'Yes'\n  - name: 'Table 6b: Top-k Stability'\n    columns:\n    - k\n    - Overlap(raw, G-MFRM)\n    - Overlap(CJ+discard, G-MFRM)\n    - Overlap(sequential, G-MFRM)\n    sample_rows:\n    - - '5'\n      - 4/5 (80%)\n      - 5/5 (100%)\n      - 4/5 (80%)\n    - - '10'\n      - 7/10 (70%)\n      - 9/10 (90%)\n      - 8/10 (80%)\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 5: Bar chart of Kendall-τ across all methods, both benchmarks side by side.\n    G-MFRM highest but margin small.'\n  - 'Fig 6: Rank comparison alluvial diagram — raw ranks → G-MFRM fair ranks, highlighting\n    the 2 models with ≥2 position change.'\n  - 'Fig 7: Diagnostic output comparison matrix — checkmarks for which methods provide\n    θ, d_j, c_n, e_i outputs. Only G-MFRM provides all four.'\n  analysis: 'G-MFRM在所有metrics上numerically best，但vs CyclicJudge+discard的优势borderline\n    (p=0.073)。 这正是median档Tier B narrative的触发条件。 Fig 7（diagnostic output comparison）成为关键卖点：所有baseline只输出corrected\n    scores， G-MFRM额外输出per-model c_n、per-item e_i、per-judge d_j——这是unique contribution。\n    Rank change分析显示corrections targeted：Model-X-70B下降3位（c_n=1.28，最重contamination），\n    但大多数模型rank变化≤1位，说明moderate contamination下校正是surgical而非sweeping。\n\n    '\n- name: contamination_magnitude_calibration\n  plan_id: exp-005\n  description: '将exp-003的fitted c_n与MVP synthetic assumptions对比，确定real contamination\n    magnitude所在区间。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    c_n_median_fitted: 0.48\n    c_n_mean_fitted: 0.54\n    c_n_p25: 0.18\n    c_n_p75: 0.78\n    closest_mvp: between mvp_001 (c~0.5) and mvp_002 (c~1.5), closer to mvp_001\n    tier_determination: median → Tier B\n    models_with_c_n_gt_1: 2\n    models_with_c_n_lt_0_1: 5\n    c_n_distribution_shape: right-skewed, mode near 0.2, long tail to ~1.35\n    constat_delta_vs_c_n_spearman: 0.52\n    constat_delta_vs_c_n_pearson: 0.47\n  result_rationale: 'c_n median=0.48直接落在median档定义的[0.3, 0.8)区间内。这接近mvp_001（c~0.5）而非mvp_002/003（c~1.5）。\n    分布右偏（mode~0.2, median~0.48, mean~0.54）反映了真实情况：大多数模型contamination轻微， 少数模型（likely\n    trained on leaked benchmark data）有较高contamination。 仅2个模型的c_n > 1.0，说明\"heavy contamination\"是exception而非norm——\n    这解释了为什么G-MFRM的ranking improvement modest：只有少数模型需要大幅校正。 ConStat validation ρ=0.52（[0.4,\n    0.7)范围）提供了moderate external validation， 说明c_n captures real contamination signal但不是perfect\n    proxy（ConStat measures different aspect）。 这个结果正式触发Tier B narrative decision。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 7: Contamination Magnitude — Real vs Synthetic'\n    columns:\n    - Statistic\n    - Real Data (exp-003)\n    - MVP_001 (synthetic)\n    - MVP_002 (synthetic)\n    - MVP_003 (synthetic)\n    sample_rows:\n    - - c_n median\n      - '0.48'\n      - '0.50'\n      - '1.50'\n      - '1.50'\n    - - c_n mean\n      - '0.54'\n      - '0.50'\n      - '1.50'\n      - '1.50'\n    - - c_n std\n      - '0.35'\n      - '0.10'\n      - '0.30'\n      - '0.30'\n    - - c_n range\n      - '[0.05, 1.35]'\n      - '[0.3, 0.7]'\n      - '[0.8, 2.0]'\n      - '[0.8, 2.0]'\n    - - '% models c_n > 0.8'\n      - 18%\n      - 0%\n      - 100%\n      - 100%\n  - name: 'Table S5: ConStat Validation'\n    columns:\n    - Metric\n    - Value\n    - 95% CI\n    sample_rows:\n    - - Spearman ρ (ConStat Δ vs c_n)\n      - '0.52'\n      - '[0.31, 0.69]'\n    - - Pearson r (ConStat Δ vs c_n)\n      - '0.47'\n      - '[0.25, 0.65]'\n    - - Kendall τ (ConStat Δ vs c_n)\n      - '0.38'\n      - '[0.18, 0.55]'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 8: c_n distribution overlay — real data (histogram) vs MVP_001 and MVP_003\n    synthetic (density curves). Real data closest to MVP_001 but with heavier tail.'\n  - 'Fig 9: Scatter plot of ConStat per-model Δ vs G-MFRM c_n, with ρ=0.52 annotated.'\n  analysis: 'This is the tier-determining experiment. c_n median=0.48确认Tier B。 关键implication：ranking\n    correction虽然有效但不dramatic，paper必须pivot to diagnostic contribution。 但分布的heavy tail（2个模型c_n\n    > 1.0）提供了\"contamination can be severe for specific models\"的evidence， 支持forward-looking\n    argument：\"as contamination grows, joint estimation becomes increasingly critical。\"\n    ConStat中等验证(ρ=0.52)说明c_n不是noise但也不是perfect——足以claim validity，不足以claim definitive。\n\n    '\n- name: judge_count_sensitivity\n  plan_id: exp-006\n  description: 'Judge数量敏感性分析：2/4/6/8个judges下G-MFRM performance degradation。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    tau_2_judges: 0.81\n    tau_4_judges: 0.85\n    tau_6_judges: 0.86\n    tau_8_judges: 0.87\n    tau_2_judges_mfrm_only: 0.8\n    tau_4_judges_mfrm_only: 0.82\n    delta_gmfrm_vs_sequential_2_judges: 0.0\n    delta_gmfrm_vs_sequential_4_judges: 0.01\n    delta_gmfrm_vs_sequential_6_judges: 0.02\n    delta_gmfrm_vs_sequential_8_judges: 0.03\n    min_judges_for_significant_gain: 5\n    convergence_2_judges_max_rhat: 1.25\n    convergence_4_judges_max_rhat: 1.09\n    convergence_6_judges_max_rhat: 1.08\n    convergence_8_judges_max_rhat: 1.07\n  result_rationale: 'Median档假设min judge count for significant gain在[4, 6]范围。预测5个judges是拐点。\n    2 judges时G-MFRM无法区分judge severity和contamination（under-identified）， 退化到MFRM-level（τ=0.81\n    vs MFRM τ=0.80），R̂=1.25表明不收敛—— 这是graceful degradation的empirical validation。 4\n    judges开始有信号但gain仍小（Δτ=+0.01），因为moderate contamination下 4个judge的cross-information不足以精确估计c_n\n    posterior。 6-8 judges时gain stabilize（Δτ=+0.02-0.03），c_n posterior tighten。 这个结果支持\"≥5\n    judges recommended\"的practitioner guidance， 也诚实地展示了G-MFRM的practical limitation。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 8: Judge Count Sensitivity'\n    columns:\n    - '# Judges'\n    - G-MFRM τ\n    - Sequential τ\n    - Δτ\n    - Max R̂\n    - Min ESS\n    - Significant? (p<0.05)\n    sample_rows:\n    - - '2'\n      - '0.81'\n      - '0.81'\n      - '0.00'\n      - '1.25'\n      - '35'\n      - 'No'\n    - - '4'\n      - '0.85'\n      - '0.84'\n      - '+0.01'\n      - '1.09'\n      - '92'\n      - 'No'\n    - - '5'\n      - '0.86'\n      - '0.84'\n      - '+0.02'\n      - '1.08'\n      - '115'\n      - Yes (p=0.04)\n    - - '6'\n      - '0.86'\n      - '0.84'\n      - '+0.02'\n      - '1.08'\n      - '128'\n      - Yes (p=0.03)\n    - - '8'\n      - '0.87'\n      - '0.84'\n      - '+0.03'\n      - '1.07'\n      - '142'\n      - Yes (p=0.02)\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 10: Line plot of Kendall-τ vs judge count for G-MFRM, MFRM, sequential, and\n    raw average. G-MFRM curve diverges from sequential at 4+ judges.'\n  - 'Fig S6: R̂ and ESS vs judge count, showing convergence improves monotonically.'\n  analysis: '实用建议：5个judges是cost-benefit sweet spot。2个judges时G-MFRM无害（graceful degradation\n    to MFRM） 但也无contamination-correction benefit。 Addresses Reviewer Concern #8：cost-benefit明确，4\n    judges下G-MFRM不worse than MFRM， practitioners不需要担心\"judges不够多时method会hurt\"。\n\n    '\n- name: exposure_indicator_ablation\n  plan_id: exp-007\n  description: 'Leave-one-out ablation：每次移除一个e_i source，测量对downstream θ̂质量的影响。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    full_tau: 0.87\n    full_c_n_recovery_rmse: 0.22\n    no_logprober_tau: 0.865\n    no_logprober_c_n_rmse: 0.24\n    no_logprober_delta_tau: -0.005\n    no_temporal_tau: 0.86\n    no_temporal_c_n_rmse: 0.26\n    no_temporal_delta_tau: -0.01\n    no_primary_tau: 0.83\n    no_primary_c_n_rmse: 0.38\n    no_primary_delta_tau: -0.04\n    only_primary_tau: 0.86\n    only_primary_c_n_rmse: 0.27\n  result_rationale: 'Median档假设\"one source contributes little\"，这里是LogProber。 去除LogProber几乎不影响downstream\n    performance（Δτ=-0.005），因为： (1) LogProber覆盖率仅55%，缺失模型需要impute； (2) LogProber与primary\n    source的correlation最低（r=0.41），其unique information有限； (3) moderate contamination下，token-level\n    memorization信号弱于item-level performance gap。 去除temporal影响稍大（Δτ=-0.01）但仍modest，因覆盖率仅45%。\n    去除primary source影响显著（Δτ=-0.04），因它是唯一100%覆盖的source且与contamination最直接相关。 关键结论：2/3\n    sources (primary + temporal) 几乎match full pipeline， 这简化了practitioners的pipeline——不需要LogProber\n    access也能获得good e_i estimates。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 9: Exposure Indicator Ablation'\n    columns:\n    - Configuration\n    - Sources Used\n    - e_i Coverage\n    - G-MFRM τ\n    - c_n RMSE\n    - Δτ vs Full\n    sample_rows:\n    - - Full Pipeline\n      - Primary + Temporal + LogProber\n      - 100%\n      - '0.870'\n      - '0.22'\n      - —\n    - - −LogProber\n      - Primary + Temporal\n      - 100%\n      - '0.865'\n      - '0.24'\n      - −0.005\n    - - −Temporal\n      - Primary + LogProber\n      - 100%\n      - '0.860'\n      - '0.26'\n      - −0.010\n    - - −Primary\n      - Temporal + LogProber\n      - 55%\n      - '0.830'\n      - '0.38'\n      - −0.040\n    - - Primary Only\n      - Primary\n      - 100%\n      - '0.860'\n      - '0.27'\n      - −0.010\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 11: Bar chart of Kendall-τ for each ablation configuration, with error bars\n    from bootstrap.'\n  analysis: 'Primary source是backbone，贡献最大。LogProber可被省略（对practitioners友好）。 Temporal有marginal但real\n    contribution（+0.005 τ over primary-only），值得保留但non-essential。 这支持了\"2/3 sources\n    sufficient\"的median档预期。 论文中应强调primary source的simplicity（仅需original + rephrased\n    variants的performance gap）， 降低method的perceived complexity。\n\n    '\n- name: facet_fit_diagnostics\n  plan_id: exp-008\n  description: 'Measurement quality validation：infit/outfit MNSQ, person-fit (lz,\n    EMRi), divergent transitions, posterior predictive checks, trace plots。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    theta_infit_mnsq_range:\n    - 0.72\n    - 1.35\n    theta_outfit_mnsq_range:\n    - 0.68\n    - 1.42\n    theta_misfitting_count: 2\n    item_infit_mnsq_range:\n    - 0.78\n    - 1.28\n    item_misfitting_count: 5\n    judge_infit_mnsq_range:\n    - 0.82\n    - 1.22\n    judge_misfitting_count: 1\n    c_n_infit_mnsq_range:\n    - 0.65\n    - 1.48\n    c_n_misfitting_count: 3\n    stage1_lz_flagged_models: 4\n    stage3_cn_gt_0_8_models: 4\n    overlap_lz_and_cn: 3\n    ppc_mean_residual: 0.02\n    ppc_95pct_residuals_in_band: 91.5\n    divergent_transitions_total: 12\n    divergent_transitions_pct: 0.075\n    trace_quality_theta: good\n    trace_quality_c_n: adequate with slow mixing for 2 models\n  result_rationale: 'Median档下model fit \"works but not perfectly\"。 θ的infit/outfit大部分在[0.7,\n    1.3]可接受范围，2个models misfitting（可能是能力profile异常的模型， 如specialized coding model在非coding\n    items上表现与Rasch unidimensionality不符）。 c_n的fit较差（3个misfitting），因为rank-1 assumption\n    (c_n·e_i) 对某些models是approximate： 部分models的contamination pattern可能不proportional\n    to item exposure， 但MNSQ < 1.5说明misfit不severe enough to invalidate model。 Person-fit\n    comparison（Stage 1 lz vs Stage 3 c_n）显示3/4 overlap—— Stage 1检测为\"anomalous\"的模型在Stage\n    3被identified as contaminated， 这提供了construct coherence validation（contamination\n    IS the source of person misfit）。 PPC 91.5%的residuals in 95% band略低于ideal（95%），12个divergent\n    transitions (0.075%) 在可接受范围但提示c_n posterior geometry有局部困难。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 10: Facet Fit Summary (Infit/Outfit MNSQ)'\n    columns:\n    - Facet\n    - N\n    - Infit Range\n    - Outfit Range\n    - Misfitting (>1.3 or <0.7)\n    - '% Misfitting'\n    sample_rows:\n    - - θ (model ability)\n      - '22'\n      - '[0.72, 1.35]'\n      - '[0.68, 1.42]'\n      - '2'\n      - 9.1%\n    - - b (item difficulty)\n      - '180'\n      - '[0.78, 1.28]'\n      - '[0.75, 1.32]'\n      - '5'\n      - 2.8%\n    - - d (judge severity)\n      - '8'\n      - '[0.82, 1.22]'\n      - '[0.80, 1.25]'\n      - '1'\n      - 12.5%\n    - - c (contamination)\n      - '22'\n      - '[0.65, 1.48]'\n      - '[0.62, 1.55]'\n      - '3'\n      - 13.6%\n  - name: 'Table S7: Person-Fit Cross-Validation'\n    columns:\n    - Model\n    - Stage 1 lz\n    - Stage 1 Flag?\n    - Stage 3 c_n\n    - Stage 3 c_n > 0.8?\n    note: 3 of 4 lz-flagged models also have c_n > 0.8, supporting construct coherence.\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig S7: Infit/Outfit MNSQ Wright Map for all facets.'\n  - 'Fig S8: Posterior predictive check — observed vs predicted score distributions.'\n  - 'Fig S9: Trace plots for c_n of 4 highest-contamination models.'\n  - 'Fig S10: Stage 1 person-fit (lz) vs Stage 3 c_n scatter plot.'\n  analysis: 'Overall model fit acceptable for a novel psychometric model on real LLM\n    evaluation data. c_n facet的fit稍弱是预期内的——rank-1 assumption是simplification， 但misfit程度（MNSQ\n    < 1.5）不足以reject model。 Person-fit cross-validation（3/4 overlap）是一个强validation\n    signal， 可在paper中作为\"contamination构念效度\"的证据。 Limitations应讨论c_n misfitting models和rank-1\n    assumption的局限性。\n\n    '\n- name: confounding_formal_observation\n  plan_id: exp-009\n  description: 'Formal bias analysis + Monte Carlo validation + synthetic c_n recovery。\n    Frame as Observation (standard OVB)。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    bias_direction: sign(Cov(d_j, c_n·e_i)) determines bias direction\n    bias_magnitude_first_order: O(σ_d · σ_c · ρ_{d,c·e})\n    mc_rho_0_theta_rmse_sequential: 0.155\n    mc_rho_0_theta_rmse_joint: 0.15\n    mc_rho_0_3_theta_rmse_sequential: 0.168\n    mc_rho_0_3_theta_rmse_joint: 0.148\n    mc_rho_0_6_theta_rmse_sequential: 0.198\n    mc_rho_0_6_theta_rmse_joint: 0.145\n    mc_rho_0_6_degradation_pct: 36.6\n    c_n_recovery_rmse_c_low: 0.12\n    c_n_recovery_rmse_c_moderate: 0.22\n    c_n_recovery_rmse_c_high: 0.18\n    c_n_95ci_coverage_overall: 0.88\n    c_n_95ci_coverage_c_gt_0_8: 0.82\n    c_n_mean_bias: 0.03\n  result_rationale: 'Monte Carlo在ρ=0时两方法RMSE接近（无confounding → no advantage）， 但ρ=0.6时sequential的RMSE升36.6%——低于mvp_003的43.8%因为此Monte\n    Carlo 使用更realistic的moderate contamination parameters（c_n ~ mvp_001 level而非mvp_003）。\n    c_n recovery RMSE在moderate contamination regime为0.22，落在[0.15, 0.3]范围—— moderate\n    contamination比strong contamination更难recover（信号弱）， 但比very weak contamination更容易（有足够信号区分contaminated\n    vs clean）。 95% CI coverage 88% < nominal 95%，说明posterior略under-covers， 主要因为staged\n    estimation（e_i fixed）低估了total uncertainty——这是honest limitation。 c_n > 0.8的coverage更低（82%），因为high-c_n\n    models的posterior更sensitive to e_i error。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 1: Sequential vs Joint Estimation Under Confounding (Monte Carlo)'\n    columns:\n    - ρ(d,c·e)\n    - θ-RMSE Sequential\n    - θ-RMSE Joint\n    - Degradation %\n    - p-value\n    sample_rows:\n    - - '0.0'\n      - 0.155±0.024\n      - 0.150±0.026\n      - 3.3%\n      - '0.42'\n    - - '0.1'\n      - 0.158±0.025\n      - 0.149±0.025\n      - 6.0%\n      - '0.31'\n    - - '0.3'\n      - 0.168±0.027\n      - 0.148±0.024\n      - 13.5%\n      - '0.04'\n    - - '0.6'\n      - 0.198±0.031\n      - 0.145±0.023\n      - 36.6%\n      - < 0.001\n    - - '0.9'\n      - 0.265±0.042\n      - 0.142±0.022\n      - 86.6%\n      - < 0.001\n  - name: 'Table S1: Synthetic c_n Recovery'\n    columns:\n    - True c_n Range\n    - N Models\n    - Recovery RMSE\n    - Mean Bias\n    - 95% CI Coverage\n    sample_rows:\n    - - '[0, 0.3)'\n      - '7'\n      - '0.12'\n      - '+0.02'\n      - 92%\n    - - '[0.3, 0.8)'\n      - '9'\n      - '0.22'\n      - '+0.03'\n      - 88%\n    - - '[0.8, 1.5]'\n      - '4'\n      - '0.18'\n      - '+0.05'\n      - 82%\n    - - Overall\n      - '20'\n      - '0.19'\n      - '+0.03'\n      - 88%\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 1 (Section 2): Toy example showing confounding mechanism. Left: sequential\n    pipeline with bias arrows. Right: G-MFRM joint estimation.'\n  - 'Fig S1: θ-RMSE vs ρ curves for sequential (rising) and joint (flat), clearly\n    showing confounding sensitivity.'\n  - 'Fig S2: c_n scatter (true vs recovered) with 45° reference line and 95% CI bands.'\n  analysis: 'Observation成立：sequential estimator的bias随confounding strength单调增加， joint\n    estimator对confounding robust。Moderate contamination regime（median档）下， sequential\n    degradation ~13-37%（取决于ρ），G-MFRM consistently better。 c_n recovery RMSE=0.22支持\"G-MFRM\n    can meaningfully estimate contamination\"但 coverage < 95%是honest limitation。 Paper\n    Section 2应lead with这个Observation + toy example figure作为motivation。\n\n    '\n- name: error_propagation_sensitivity\n  plan_id: exp-012\n  description: 'Staged estimation的error propagation：向e_i注入σ=0.1/0.2/0.5的Gaussian noise，\n    测量θ̂ RMSE degradation和c_n recovery accuracy。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    theta_rmse_sigma_0_0: 0.145\n    theta_rmse_sigma_0_1: 0.152\n    theta_rmse_sigma_0_2: 0.168\n    theta_rmse_sigma_0_5: 0.225\n    theta_rmse_degradation_sigma_0_1_pct: 4.8\n    theta_rmse_degradation_sigma_0_2_pct: 15.9\n    theta_rmse_degradation_sigma_0_5_pct: 55.2\n    c_n_rmse_sigma_0_0: 0.19\n    c_n_rmse_sigma_0_1: 0.22\n    c_n_rmse_sigma_0_2: 0.3\n    c_n_rmse_sigma_0_5: 0.52\n    still_beats_sequential_sigma_0_1: true\n    still_beats_sequential_sigma_0_2: true\n    still_beats_sequential_sigma_0_5: false\n    breakeven_sigma: 0.38\n  result_rationale: 'Median档假设σ=0.2时degradation在[5%, 15%]范围。预测15.9%接近上界， 因为moderate\n    contamination下θ̂对e_i noise更sensitive—— 当c_n本身较小时，e_i的noise相对于c_n·e_i signal的比例更大。\n    σ=0.1时degradation ~5%（可接受），σ=0.5时degradation ~55%（不可接受，method breaks down）。 Breakeven\n    point σ≈0.38：e_i noise超过此阈值时G-MFRM不再优于sequential。 这是Tier B narrative的重要组成部分——staged\n    estimation在reasonable e_i quality下robust， 但有clear failure mode。Paper Limitations必须讨论。\n    c_n recovery RMSE的degradation更steep（0.19→0.52 at σ=0.5）， 因为c_n directly depends\n    on e_i through gating mechanism。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 11: Error Propagation Sensitivity (Synthetic)'\n    columns:\n    - e_i Noise σ\n    - θ̂ RMSE\n    - Degradation %\n    - c_n RMSE\n    - Beats Sequential?\n    - p vs Sequential\n    sample_rows:\n    - - 0.0 (oracle)\n      - '0.145'\n      - —\n      - '0.19'\n      - 'Yes'\n      - < 0.001\n    - - '0.1'\n      - '0.152'\n      - 4.8%\n      - '0.22'\n      - 'Yes'\n      - < 0.001\n    - - '0.2'\n      - '0.168'\n      - 15.9%\n      - '0.30'\n      - 'Yes'\n      - '0.02'\n    - - '0.3'\n      - '0.192'\n      - 32.4%\n      - '0.39'\n      - Marginal\n      - '0.08'\n    - - '0.5'\n      - '0.225'\n      - 55.2%\n      - '0.52'\n      - 'No'\n      - '0.35'\n  - name: 'Table S8: Breakeven Analysis'\n    columns:\n    - Metric\n    - Value\n    sample_rows:\n    - - Breakeven σ (G-MFRM τ = Sequential τ)\n      - '0.38'\n    - - Estimated real e_i pipeline σ\n      - 0.15–0.20\n    - - Safety margin\n      - 1.9–2.5×\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 12: θ̂ RMSE vs e_i noise σ, with sequential baseline as horizontal dashed\n    line. Intersection at σ≈0.38.'\n  - 'Fig S11: c_n recovery scatter plots at each noise level, showing increasing dispersion.'\n  analysis: 'Staged estimation在realistic noise levels下robust（safety margin ~2×）， 但不是unconditionally\n    robust。σ=0.2时degradation 15.9%处于acceptable-but-noticeable range。 Breakeven σ=0.38\n    vs estimated real pipeline σ=0.15-0.20 gives safety margin of ~2×。 This directly\n    addresses Reviewer Concern #4b和Dream R1-N1： staged estimation是principled且empirically\n    robust，但paper必须state the limitation clearly。\n\n    '\n- name: wildbench_replication\n  plan_id: exp-010\n  description: 'WildBench上复现G-MFRM pipeline作为第三个benchmark。Cross-benchmark generalization。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    wildbench_num_items: 1024\n    wildbench_num_judges_used: 6\n    tau_raw_average: 0.76\n    tau_mfrm_only: 0.79\n    tau_sequential: 0.81\n    tau_cyclicjudge_discard: 0.82\n    tau_gmfrm: 0.84\n    delta_tau_vs_best_baseline: 0.02\n    c_n_median_wildbench: 0.38\n    c_n_correlation_with_mtbench: 0.72\n    convergence_max_rhat: 1.09\n    convergence_min_ess: 108\n    wilcoxon_gmfrm_vs_best_p: 0.065\n  result_rationale: 'WildBench的contamination预期更低（c_n median=0.38 vs MT-Bench 0.48），\n    因为WildBench items更diverse且更新更频繁。 6个judges（cost constraint）接近minimum threshold（exp-006预测5个为拐点），\n    所以convergence和performance都marginal worse than MT-Bench/Arena-Hard。 Δτ=+0.02 vs\n    best baseline，p=0.065——again borderline，consistent with median档。 Cross-benchmark\n    c_n correlation r=0.72说明contamination是model-level trait （某些模型consistently contaminated\n    across benchmarks），这是有价值的diagnostic insight。 WildBench主要价值是generalization evidence，即使improvement\n    modest。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table S9: WildBench Results'\n    columns:\n    - Method\n    - Kendall-τ\n    - Spearman-ρ\n    - p vs G-MFRM\n    sample_rows:\n    - - Raw Average\n      - '0.76'\n      - '0.80'\n      - '0.003'\n    - - Sequential\n      - '0.81'\n      - '0.85'\n      - '0.031'\n    - - CyclicJudge+Discard\n      - '0.82'\n      - '0.86'\n      - '0.065'\n    - - '**G-MFRM**'\n      - '**0.84**'\n      - '**0.88**'\n      - —\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig S12: Cross-benchmark c_n correlation scatter (MT-Bench c_n vs WildBench c_n),\n    r=0.72.'\n  analysis: 'WildBench replication确认G-MFRM在第三个benchmark上也numerically best，但advantage同样modest。\n    Cross-benchmark c_n correlation是strong secondary finding： contamination susceptibility\n    is a model property, not a benchmark artifact—— strengthens the case for per-model\n    contamination audit as diagnostic tool。 Whether to include in main paper depends\n    on page budget；可放appendix if space-constrained。\n\n    '\n- name: adversarial_robustness\n  plan_id: exp-011\n  description: '按Wang et al. (ICLR 2026) fragility findings测试G-MFRM robustness。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    scenario_judge_collusion_tau_drop: 0.04\n    scenario_strategic_contamination_tau_drop: 0.06\n    scenario_item_poisoning_tau_drop: 0.03\n    baseline_sequential_collusion_tau_drop: 0.07\n    baseline_cyclicjudge_collusion_tau_drop: 0.05\n    gmfrm_detects_collusion_via_d_j_outlier: true\n    gmfrm_detects_strategic_contam_via_c_n_pattern: partially\n    gmfrm_more_robust_than_baselines: mixed — more robust to judge collusion, similarly\n      vulnerable to strategic contamination\n  result_rationale: 'Median档下adversarial robustness预期为mixed results。 Judge collusion（部分judges协调inflate某模型）：G-MFRM的multi-facet\n    estimation比sequential更robust （Δτ drop 0.04 vs 0.07），因为d_j estimation可以部分absorb\n    coordinated judge behavior。 Strategic contamination（模型deliberately leak but hide\n    signals）：G-MFRM与baselines similarly vulnerable （Δτ drop 0.06），因为e_i estimation依赖performance\n    gap，deliberate obfuscation可以defeat this signal。 但G-MFRM的diagnostic outputs（d_j\n    outlier detection）提供了detection capability其他方法没有。 这是P2 experiment——如果space允许放入paper，主要价值是demonstrates\n    diagnostic use case。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table S10: Adversarial Robustness'\n    columns:\n    - Scenario\n    - G-MFRM τ Drop\n    - Sequential τ Drop\n    - CyclicJudge τ Drop\n    - G-MFRM Detects?\n    sample_rows:\n    - - Judge Collusion (2/8 judges)\n      - −0.04\n      - −0.07\n      - −0.05\n      - Yes (d_j outlier)\n    - - Strategic Contamination\n      - −0.06\n      - −0.06\n      - −0.06\n      - Partial (c_n pattern)\n    - - Item Poisoning (10% items)\n      - −0.03\n      - −0.04\n      - −0.03\n      - Yes (infit outlier)\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig S13: τ degradation under each adversarial scenario, comparing methods.'\n  analysis: G-MFRM不是adversarially robust的silver bullet，但diagnostic outputs提供了detection\n    capability。 Judge collusion detection通过d_j outlier是实际可行的——这是\"judge selection guidance\"贡献的具体体现。\n    Paper中如果include，应framing为\"G-MFRM's diagnostic outputs enable detection of evaluation\n    manipulation\"， 而非\"G-MFRM is robust to adversarial attack\"。\n","numLines":1202,"startLine":1,"totalLines":1202}}}
